#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Alchemy field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Alchemy:Description"
msgid "The alchemy skill allows you to mix potions.  Without the alchemy skill, you barely have the knowledge to make a simple potion, though alchemy skill is added to the strength value of the base ingredient to determine the strength of a simple potion. Higher rankings allow you to mix more complicated potions."
msgstr "연금술 기술은 물약을 혼합할 수 있게 합니다. 연금술 기술이 없어도 간단한 물약은 만들 수 있으며, 간단한 물약의 효능은 기본 재료의 효능에 연금술 기술 수치를 더해 결정됩니다. 숙련 단계가 높아질수록 더 복잡한 물약을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Alchemy field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Alchemy:DisplayName"
msgid "Alchemy"
msgstr "연금술"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Alchemy field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Alchemy:Expert"
msgid "Allows mixing of complex potions to make compound potions"
msgstr "복합 물약을 섞어 합성 물약 제조 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Alchemy field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Alchemy:GrandMaster"
msgid "Allows mixing of white potions to make black potions"
msgstr "흰색 물약을 섞어 검은색 물약 제조 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Alchemy field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Alchemy:Master"
msgid "Allows mixing of compound potions to make white potions"
msgstr "합성 물약을 섞어 흰색 물약 제조 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Alchemy field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Alchemy:Normal"
msgid "Allows mixing of simple potions to make complex potions"
msgstr "단순 물약을 섞어 복합 물약 제조 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Armsmaster field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Armsmaster:Description"
msgid "Armsmaster skill represents the warrior's tricks of the trade.  Initially, armsmaster reduces the recovery times of your melee weapons. At higher expertise levels it gives you a bonus to hit then to damage."
msgstr "무술 기술은 숙련된 전사의 전투 요령을 나타냅니다. 기본적으로 모든 근접 무기의 회복 시간을 줄이며, 숙련 단계가 높아지면 명중 보너스와 피해 보너스를 차례로 얻습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Armsmaster field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Armsmaster:DisplayName"
msgid "Armsmaster"
msgstr "무술"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Armsmaster field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Armsmaster:Expert"
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus of all melee weapons"
msgstr "모든 근접 무기의 공격 보너스에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Armsmaster field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Armsmaster:GrandMaster"
msgid "Double all the previous bonuses"
msgstr "앞선 모든 보너스를 2배로 적용"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Armsmaster field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Armsmaster:Master"
msgid "Skill added to damage of all melee weapons"
msgstr "모든 근접 무기의 피해에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Armsmaster field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Armsmaster:Normal"
msgid "Skill reduces the recovery time of all melee weapons"
msgstr "모든 근접 무기의 회복 시간 감소"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Axe field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Axe:Description"
msgid "While slow on the attack, axes do a lot of damage when they hit.  Expert axe fighters gain a little more speed on their attacks while master axe fighters can deliver extra damage."
msgstr "도끼는 공격 속도는 느리지만 명중하면 큰 피해를 줍니다. 전문가는 공격 속도가 조금 빨라지고, 마스터는 추가 피해를 줄 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Axe field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Axe:DisplayName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

