msgstr "기술 효과 3배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Bodybuilding field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Bodybuilding:Normal"
msgid "Skill adds to Hit Points"
msgstr "생명력에 기술 수치 적용"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Bow field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Bow:Description"
msgid "Bow skill covers both bow and crossbow usage.  Expert archers gain a speed increase with their weapon, while master archers can fire two arrows with every attack."
msgstr "활 기술은 활과 석궁 사용을 모두 다룹니다. 전문가는 무기 공격 속도가 빨라지고, 마스터는 한 번 공격할 때 화살 두 발을 발사할 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Bow field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Bow:DisplayName"
msgid "Bow"
msgstr "활"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Bow field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Bow:Expert"
msgid "Skill reduces recovery time"
msgstr "기술 수치에 따라 회복 시간 감소"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Bow field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Bow:GrandMaster"
msgid "Skill added to damage."
msgstr "피해에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Bow field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Bow:Master"
msgid "Bow fires two arrows on every attack"
msgstr "공격할 때마다 화살 두 발 발사"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Bow field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Bow:Normal"
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus"
msgstr "공격 보너스에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Chain field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Chain:Description"
msgid "Chain armor is the medium armor type.  It provides more protection than leather and less than plate, but it also slows your character down more than leather.  Chain armor skill increases the protection offered by chain armor."
msgstr "사슬 갑옷은 중간 등급의 갑옷입니다. 가죽 갑옷보다 방어력이 높고 판금 갑옷보다는 낮지만, 가죽 갑옷보다 캐릭터의 행동을 더 느리게 합니다. 사슬 갑옷 기술은 사슬 갑옷의 방어 효과를 높입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Chain field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Chain:DisplayName"
msgid "Chain"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Chain field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Chain:Expert"
msgid "Recovery penalty halved"
msgstr "회복 시간 페널티 절반 감소"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Chain field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Chain:GrandMaster"
msgid "Receive 2/3 damage from physical attacks."
msgstr "물리 공격 피해를 2/3만 받음"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Chain field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Chain:Master"
msgid "Recovery penalty eliminated"
msgstr "회복 시간 페널티 제거"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Chain field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Chain:Normal"
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class"
msgstr "방어력에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dagger field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dagger:Description"
msgid "While daggers don’t do the kind of damage that a sword or an axe can deliver, they are very quick—sometimes letting you get two attacks for every one of your slower opponents'.  Expert dagger fighters can wield a dagger in their left hand while using another weapon in their right.  Master dagger fighters have a chance of doing a triple damage attack."
msgstr "단검은 검이나 도끼만큼 큰 피해를 주지는 못하지만 매우 빠르며, 느린 적이 한 번 공격할 동안 두 번 공격할 수도 있습니다. 전문가는 왼손에 단검을 들고 오른손에 다른 무기를 사용할 수 있습니다. 마스터는 기술 수치에 비례한 확률로 3배 피해를 줄 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dagger field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dagger:DisplayName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dagger field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dagger:Expert"
msgid "Permits use of dagger in left hand"
msgstr "왼손에 단검 착용 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dagger field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dagger:GrandMaster"
msgid "Skill added to Attack Damage"
msgstr "공격 피해에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dagger field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dagger:Master"
msgid "Chance to cause triple damage equal to skill"
msgstr "기술 수치만큼 3배 피해 발생 확률 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dagger field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dagger:Normal"
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus"
msgstr "공격 보너스에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark:Description"
msgid "Only usable by necromancers, dark magic has the most spectacular damaging and creature controlling spells available. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr "강령술사만 사용할 수 있는 어둠 마법에는 가장 화려하고 강력한 피해 주문과 생물 조종 주문들이 포함되어 있습니다. 숙련 단계가 높아지면 더 강력한 주문을 배우고 알고 있는 주문을 더 효과적으로 시전할 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark:DisplayName"
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "어둠 마법"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark:Expert"
msgid "Effects vary per spell"
msgstr "주문마다 효과가 다름"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark:GrandMaster"
msgid "Effects vary per spell"
msgstr "주문마다 효과가 다름"

