msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark:Master"
msgid "Effects vary per spell"
msgstr "주문마다 효과가 다름"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark:Normal"
msgid "Effects vary per spell"
msgstr "주문마다 효과가 다름"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark Elf Ability field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark_Elf_Ability:Description"
msgid "Dark Elves are born with abilities not shared by other races. Like the racial abilities of Vampires and Dragons, Dark Elven abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. Dark Elves start out able to cast Glamour, then gain Travelers' Boon, Blind, and Darkfire Bolt as they gain expert, master and grandmaster ranking."
msgstr "다크 엘프는 다른 종족에게 없는 능력을 타고납니다. 뱀파이어와 드래곤의 종족 능력처럼 주문처럼 사용하지만 기술처럼 습득합니다. 처음에는 매혹(Glamour)을 사용할 수 있으며 전문가, 마스터, 그랜드마스터가 되면서 여행자의 축복(Travelers' Boon), 실명(Blind), 암흑 화염(Darkfire)을 차례로 얻습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark Elf Ability field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark_Elf_Ability:DisplayName"
msgid "Dark Elf Ability"
msgstr "다크 엘프 능력"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark Elf Ability field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark_Elf_Ability:Expert"
msgid "Can cast Travelers' Boon which has effects of Torchlight, Wizard Eye and Feather Fall."
msgstr "여행자의 축복(Travelers' Boon) 시전 가능: 횃불, 마법사의 눈, 깃털 낙하 효과"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark Elf Ability field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark_Elf_Ability:GrandMaster"
msgid "Can cast Darkfire, a magic bolt which does Dark and Fire damage."
msgstr "암흑 화염(Darkfire) 시전 가능: 어둠과 화염 피해를 주는 마법 탄환"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark Elf Ability field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark_Elf_Ability:Master"
msgid "Can cast Blind. Targets of the spell wander aimlessly and cannot use spells or missiles."
msgstr "실명(Blind) 시전 가능: 대상이 정처 없이 헤매며 주문과 원거리 공격을 사용할 수 없음"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dark Elf Ability field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dark_Elf_Ability:Normal"
msgid "Can cast Glamour which increases caster's appeal to others."
msgstr "매혹(Glamour) 시전 가능: 시전자의 매력을 높임"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Disarm Traps field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Disarm_Traps:Description"
msgid "The disarm traps skill is checked automatically when you open a trapped chest or other container.  A higher skill in disarm traps gives a better chance of disarming the trap.  Experts and masters enjoy an increased chance of disarming traps, while grandmasters always succeed."
msgstr "함정 해제 기술은 함정이 설치된 상자나 다른 용기를 열 때 자동으로 판정됩니다. 기술이 높을수록 함정을 해제할 확률이 높아집니다. 전문가와 마스터는 성공 확률이 더욱 높아지고, 그랜드마스터는 항상 성공합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Disarm Traps field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Disarm_Traps:DisplayName"
msgid "Disarm Traps"
msgstr "함정 해제"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Disarm Traps field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Disarm_Traps:Expert"
msgid "Double effect of skill"
msgstr "기술 효과 2배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Disarm Traps field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Disarm_Traps:GrandMaster"
msgid "100% success"
msgstr "100% 성공"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Disarm Traps field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Disarm_Traps:Master"
msgid "Triple effect of skill"
msgstr "기술 효과 3배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Disarm Traps field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Disarm_Traps:Normal"
msgid "Skill increases chance to disarm traps on chests"
msgstr "상자의 함정을 해제할 확률 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dodging field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dodging:Description"
msgid "Dodging skill can be used only when you are not wearing armor or using a shield.  Additional ranks of dodging will increase your armor class while not wearing armor."
msgstr "회피 기술은 갑옷이나 방패를 사용하지 않을 때만 적용됩니다. 숙련 단계가 올라갈수록 갑옷을 입지 않은 상태에서 방어력이 증가합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dodging field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dodging:DisplayName"
msgid "Dodging"
msgstr "회피"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dodging field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dodging:Expert"
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class (double effect)"
msgstr "방어력에 기술 수치 2배 적용"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dodging field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dodging:GrandMaster"
msgid "Skill is usable while wearing leather armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷을 입어도 기술 사용 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dodging field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dodging:Master"
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class (triple effect)"
msgstr "방어력에 기술 수치 3배 적용"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dodging field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dodging:Normal"
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class"
msgstr "방어력에 기술 수치 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dragon Ability field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dragon_Ability:Description"
msgid "Dragons are powerful creatures with innate abilities. Like the racial abilities of Dark Elves and Vampires, Dragon abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. Dragons begin able to cast Fear, then gain a second breath weapon, Flight, and Wing Buffet at expert, master and grandmaster rankings. Skill in Dragon ability increases both Armor Class and breath weapon damage."
msgstr "드래곤은 선천적인 능력을 지닌 강력한 생물입니다. 다크 엘프와 뱀파이어의 종족 능력처럼 주문처럼 사용하지만 기술처럼 습득합니다. 처음에는 공포(Fear)를 사용할 수 있으며 전문가, 마스터, 그랜드마스터가 되면서 두 번째 브레스 공격, 비행(Flight), 날개 치기(Wing Buffet)를 차례로 얻습니다. 드래곤 능력 기술은 방어력과 브레스 공격 피해를 모두 높입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dragon Ability field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dragon_Ability:DisplayName"
msgid "Dragon Ability"
msgstr "드래곤 능력"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dragon Ability field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dragon_Ability:Expert"
msgid "Gains Breath Weapon which launches an exploding fireball."
msgstr "폭발하는 화염구를 발사하는 브레스 공격 획득"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dragon Ability field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dragon_Ability:GrandMaster"
msgid "Gains Wing Buffet which pushes back opponents."
msgstr "날개 치기(Wing Buffet) 획득: 적을 뒤로 밀쳐냄"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dragon Ability field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dragon_Ability:Master"
msgid "Gains Flight which allows dragon to carry party through the air."
msgstr "비행(Flight) 획득: 드래곤이 파티를 태우고 공중 이동 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Dragon Ability field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Dragon_Ability:Normal"
msgid "Can cast Fear which causes its targets to flee."
msgstr "공포(Fear) 시전 가능: 대상이 달아나게 함"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Earth field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Earth:Description"
msgid "Earth magic has a balanced mix of offensive and defensive spells, and includes some healing and adventuring magic.  At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr "대지 마법은 공격과 방어 주문이 균형 있게 섞여 있으며 일부 치유 및 모험용 마법도 포함합니다. 숙련 단계가 높아지면 더 강력한 주문을 배우고 알고 있는 주문을 더 효과적으로 시전할 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Earth field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Earth:DisplayName"
msgid "Earth"
msgstr "대지 마법"

