#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Item field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Item:Description"
msgid "The identify item skill is automatically applied when you right-click on an unidentified inventory item. If your character's skill is high enough, the item becomes identified."
msgstr "아이템 식별 기술은 미식별 인벤토리 아이템을 오른쪽 클릭할 때 자동으로 적용됩니다. 캐릭터의 기술이 충분히 높으면 해당 아이템을 식별합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Item field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Item:DisplayName"
msgid "Identify Item"
msgstr "아이템 식별"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Item field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Item:Expert"
msgid "Double effect of skill"
msgstr "기술 효과 2배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Item field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Item:GrandMaster"
msgid "100% success"
msgstr "100% 성공"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Item field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Item:Master"
msgid "Triple effect of skill"
msgstr "기술 효과 3배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Item field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Item:Normal"
msgid "Ability to identify items"
msgstr "아이템 식별 가능"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Monster field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Monster:Description"
msgid "The identify monster skill is applied when you right-click on a monster. At basic level, the skill allows you to see a monster's hit points and armor class. At higher expertise levels, more information is displayed."
msgstr "몬스터 식별 기술은 몬스터를 오른쪽 클릭할 때 적용됩니다. 기본 단계에서는 몬스터의 생명력과 방어력을 볼 수 있으며, 숙련 단계가 높아질수록 더 많은 정보가 표시됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Monster field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Monster:DisplayName"
msgid "Identify Monster"
msgstr "몬스터 식별"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Monster field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Monster:Expert"
msgid "Learn Attack type and damage of monster"
msgstr "몬스터의 공격 유형과 피해량 확인"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Monster field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Monster:GrandMaster"
msgid "Learn the monster's resistances"
msgstr "몬스터의 저항 확인"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Monster field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Monster:Master"
msgid "Learn which spells the monster can cast."
msgstr "몬스터가 시전할 수 있는 주문 확인"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Identify Monster field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Identify_Monster:Normal"
msgid "Learn Hit Points and Armor Class of monster"
msgstr "몬스터의 생명력과 방어력 확인"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Learning field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Learning:Description"
msgid "The learning skill directly increases the experience a character receives.  Every point of skill is a percent of awarded experience that is given as a bonus (plus a starting bonus of 9%).  Five skill points would turn a 100 experience point award into a 114 experience point award.  Expert doubles and master triples this bonus, so 10 points of learning at master rank would give a 39% bonus to all experience point gain."
msgstr "학습 기술은 캐릭터가 얻는 경험치를 직접 증가시킵니다. 기술 1점마다 획득 경험치의 1%를 추가로 얻으며 기본 보너스 9%가 더해집니다. 예를 들어 기술 5라면 경험치 100을 얻을 때 114를 받습니다. 전문가는 이 기술 보너스를 두 배, 마스터는 세 배로 적용하므로 기술 10인 마스터는 모든 경험치 획득량에 39% 보너스를 받습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Learning field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Learning:DisplayName"
msgid "Learning"
msgstr "학습"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Learning field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Learning:Expert"
msgid "Double effect of skill"
msgstr "기술 효과 2배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Learning field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Learning:GrandMaster"
msgid "Quintuple effect of skill"
msgstr "기술 효과 5배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Learning field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Learning:Master"
msgid "Triple effect of skill"
msgstr "기술 효과 3배"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Learning field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Learning:Normal"
msgid "Skill increases amount of experience received"
msgstr "획득 경험치 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Leather field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Leather:Description"
msgid "Leather armor is the lightest armor a character can wear.  While leather provides less protection than chain or plate armor, it also slows your character down the least.  Leather armor skill increases the protection offered by leather armor."
msgstr "가죽 갑옷은 캐릭터가 착용할 수 있는 가장 가벼운 갑옷입니다. 사슬이나 판금 갑옷보다 방어력은 낮지만 행동 속도를 가장 적게 늦춥니다. 가죽 갑옷 기술은 가죽 갑옷의 방어 효과를 높입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt record=Leather field=DisplayName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:english/skill_des.txt:Leather:DisplayName"
msgid "Leather"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

