msgstr "열쇠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=619 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:619:Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: The key you took from Blackwell Cooper's body."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 블랙웰 쿠퍼의 시체에서 가져온 열쇠."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=61 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:61:Name"
msgid "Light Crossbow"
msgstr "경량 석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=61 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:61:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=61 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:61:Notes"
msgid "Because of their ease of use, crossbows like these are stockpiled in militia armories everywhere. Their low pull strength and mediocre workmanship however, make them only moderately effective."
msgstr "사용이 간편하기 때문에 이러한 석궁은 전국의 민병대 무기고에 비축되어 있습니다. 하지만 당기는 힘이 약하고 제작 기술이 조악하여 효율성은 그다지 높지 않습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=620 field=Name status=translated
