msgid "Gem"
msgstr "보석"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=625 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:625:Notes"
msgid "Smooth stone without specific color."
msgstr "특정한 색상이 없는 매끄러운 돌."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=626 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:626:Name"
msgid "Prophecies of the Sun"
msgstr "태양의 예언"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=626 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:626:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Book"
msgstr "책"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=626 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:626:Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: The writing inside this book reads like the ranting of a madman. Still, someone must have thought highly of it. The text is entirely hand scribed in a florid style. Inset illuminations bring to life scenes from the story which are, in turn, disturbing, outlandish or seemingly drawn from nightmare."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 이 책 속의 글은 마치 미치광이의 횡설수설처럼 읽힌다. 하지만 누군가는 이 책을 높이 평가했던 것이 분명하다. 모든 글자는 화려한 필체로 손으로 직접 쓰여 있다. 삽입된 삽화들은 이야기 속 장면들을 생생하게 묘사하는데, 그 장면들은 섬뜩하거나, 기괴하거나, 혹은 악몽에서 튀어나온 듯하다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=627 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:627:Name"
msgid "Remains of Korbu"
msgstr "코르부의 유해"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=627 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:627:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Remains"
msgstr "유해"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=627 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:627:Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: The remains of Korbu who some claim was the most powerful vampire of all times. He's not much to look at now, however. His skeleton has been almost completely dismantled--either by design or the ravages of time, and a wooden stake is nestled entirely within the ribcage."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 역사상 가장 강력한 뱀파이어였다고 전해지는 코르부의 유해. 하지만 그의 모습은 이제 볼품없습니다. 그의 해골은 거의 완전히 해체되었는데, 의도적인 것인지 아니면 세월의 흐름 때문인지는 알 수 없지만, 갈비뼈 안에는 나무 말뚝이 박혀 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=628 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:628:Name"
msgid "Lich Jar"
msgstr "리치 항아리"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=628 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:628:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Jar"
msgstr "항아리"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=628 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:628:Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: A well made jar."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 잘 만들어진 항아리."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=629 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:629:Name"
msgid "Ring of Keys"
msgstr "열쇠고리"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=629 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:629:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring of Keys"
msgstr "열쇠고리"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=629 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:629:Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: Both the keys and ring are made of a metal you've never encountered before. The gemstones inset in the key heads are familiar to you. They are elemental heartstones like those incorporated in the conflux key Xanthor made for you."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 열쇠와 반지는 모두 당신이 전에 본 적 없는 금속으로 만들어졌습니다. 열쇠 머리에 박힌 보석은 당신에게 익숙합니다. 그것들은 크산토르가 당신을 위해 만든 융합 열쇠에 박힌 것과 같은 원소 심장석입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=62 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:62:Name"
msgid "Blood Drop Crossbow"
msgstr "핏방울 석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=62 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:62:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=62 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:62:Notes"
msgid "A light crossbow of good quality, these weapons feature a grooved table, basic sights and a smooth releasing nut."
msgstr "가볍고 품질이 우수한 이 석궁은 홈이 파인 활대, 기본적인 조준기, 그리고 부드럽게 작동하는 방아쇠 너트를 특징으로 합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=630 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:630:Name"
msgid "Idol of the Snake"
msgstr "뱀의 우상"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=630 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:630:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Idol"
msgstr "우상"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=630 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:630:Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: An Idol of the ancient snake god who was worshipped by the Serpentmen who used to dwell on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 과거 단검상섬에 거주했던 뱀인간들이 숭배했던 고대 뱀신의 우상."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=631 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:631:Name"
msgid "Big Brass Ring"
msgstr "커다란 황동 고리"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=631 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:631:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=631 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:631:Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: A large ring of polished brass. It seems to be part of a door knocker."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 윤이 나는 황동으로 된 커다란 고리. 문고리의 일부인 것 같습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=632 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:632:Name"
msgid "Naga Hide"
msgstr "나가 가죽"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=632 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:632:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "가죽"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=632 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:632:Notes"
msgid "The skinned and scraped hide of a naga."
msgstr "나가의 껍질을 벗기고 긁어낸 가죽."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=633 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:633:Name"
