msgctxt "engine:items.txt:633:Notes"
msgid "The skinned and scraped hide of a dire wolf."
msgstr "껍질을 벗기고 긁어낸 다이어 울프의 가죽."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=634 field=Name status=translated
