msgstr "프렐랑도 치즈 한 덩이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=800 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:800:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wheel of Frelandeau"
msgstr "프렐랑도 치즈"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=800 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:800:Notes"
msgid "A wheel of prized unicorn's-milk frelandeau cheese. Sliced onto crackers, it is the perfect compliment to a snifter of fine tobersk brandy."
msgstr "귀한 유니콘 젖으로 만든 프렐란도 치즈 한 덩어리. 크래커 위에 얇게 썰어 얹으면 고급 토베르스크 브랜디 한 잔과 완벽한 조화를 이룹니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=801 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:801:Name"
msgid "Log of Eldenbrie"
msgstr "엘덴브리 치즈 덩어리"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=801 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:801:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Log of Eldenbrie"
msgstr "엘덴브리 치즈"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=801 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:801:Notes"
msgid "A log of Vori eldenbrie cheese. Though many have tried to duplicate its subtle, smoky flavor, only the master Frost Giant cheese masters of the frozen Vori wastes know the secrets of its formulation."
msgstr "보리 엘덴브리 치즈 한 덩어리. 수많은 이들이 그 은은하고 스모키한 풍미를 흉내 내려 했지만, 얼어붙은 보리 황무지의 서리 거인 치즈 장인들만이 그 제조법을 알고 있다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=802 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:802:Name"
msgid "Ball of Dunduck"
msgstr "던덕 치즈 덩이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=802 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:802:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ball of Dunduck"
msgstr "던덕 치즈"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=802 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:802:Notes"
msgid "A ball of dunduck cheese. Made in small batches by the goblins of Erathia, most consider it an acquired taste."
msgstr "둔덕 치즈 한 덩어리. 에라시아의 고블린들이 소량씩 만드는 이 치즈는 호불호가 갈리는 맛으로 여겨진다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=803 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:803:Name"
msgid "Crude Longsword"
msgstr "조잡한 장검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=803 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:803:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=803 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:803:Notes"
msgid "Though notched and dented, this longsword is still an effective weapon."
msgstr "흠집과 찌그러짐이 있지만, 이 장검은 여전히 효과적인 무기이다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=804 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:804:Name"
msgid "Elven Saber"
msgstr "엘프 세이버"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=804 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:804:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Saber"
msgstr "세이버"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=804 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:804:Notes"
msgid "A common elven weapon, this saber is a deadly, if unremarkable, weapon."
msgstr "흔히 볼 수 있는 엘프 무기인 이 사브르는 특별할 것 없어 보이지만, 치명적인 무기입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=805 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:805:Name"
msgid "Keen Longsword"
msgstr "날카로운 장검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=805 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:805:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=805 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:805:Notes"
msgid "Although this longsword appears quite old, the edge of the blade is unusually sharp.  It was quite probably enchanted to remain that way during its creation."
msgstr "이 장검은 꽤 오래되어 보이지만, 칼날은 비정상적으로 날카롭습니다. 아마도 제작 당시 마법이 걸려 그 상태를 유지했을 가능성이 큽니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=806 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:806:Name"
msgid "Graceful Sword"
msgstr "우아한 검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=806 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:806:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=806 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:806:Notes"
msgid "A high quality longsword, monogrammed initials near the base of the pommel indicate it was forged by master weaponsmith Mekorig the Blind circa 780-800."
msgstr "칼자루 밑부분에 새겨진 이니셜로 보아 이 검은 780년에서 800년경에 명장 무기 제작자 장님 메코리그가 만든 것으로 추정되는 고급 장검입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=807 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:807:Name"
msgid "Duelist Blade"
msgstr "결투사의 칼날"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=807 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:807:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=807 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:807:Notes"
msgid "These rare blades were forged sometime before the Silence, and have been used by noble duelists who want to die in style for centuries.  No two are quite alike, but all share bloody histories."
msgstr "이 희귀한 검들은 침묵의 시대 이전에 벼려졌으며, 수 세기 동안 화려하게 죽음을 맞이하고자 하는 귀족 결투사들이 사용해 왔습니다. 똑같은 검은 하나도 없지만, 모두 피로 물든 역사를 공유하고 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=808 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:808:Name"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=808 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:808:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=808 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:808:Notes"
msgid "This simple two-handed sword with a leather grip is a common design in Erathia."
msgstr "가죽 손잡이가 달린 이 단순한 양손검은 에라시아에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 디자인입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=809 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:809:Name"
msgid "Great Sword"
msgstr "대검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=809 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:809:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=809 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:809:Notes"
msgid "An effective, deadly design employed by less well disciplined armies throughout time.  The smith of this particular two-handed sword thoughtfully added a blood groove down the center of the blade."
msgstr "예로부터 규율이 덜 잡힌 군대들이 사용했던 효과적이고 치명적인 무기입니다. 이 양손검을 만든 대장장이는 칼날 중앙에 혈흔 홈을 새겨 넣는 세심한 배려를 보여주었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=80 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:80:Name"
msgid "Orb Staff"
msgstr "구체 지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=80 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:80:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=80 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:80:Notes"
msgid "This staff is topped with a head of polished turquoise to give it greater striking force."
msgstr "이 지팡이의 꼭대기에는 광택이 나는 터키석 장식이 달려 있어 더욱 강렬한 인상을 줍니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=810 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:810:Name"
msgid "Heroic Sword"
msgstr "영웅의 검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=810 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:810:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=810 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:810:Notes"
msgid "It is thought by some master swordsmen that a wavy blade is a bit stronger than a straight one, and does more damage when it strikes an opponent.  That may or may not be true, but one thing is certain--this particular sword's craftsmanship is amongst the finest you've ever seen."
msgstr "일부 검술 고수들은 물결 모양의 칼날이 직선형 칼날보다 약간 더 강하고 상대를 가격했을 때 더 큰 피해를 준다고 생각합니다. 그 말이 사실일 수도 있고 아닐 수도 있지만, 한 가지는 확실합니다. 이 검의 제작 솜씨는 당신이 지금까지 본 것 중 최고 수준입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=811 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:811:Name"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=811 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:811:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=811 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:811:Notes"
msgid "A polished broadsword commonly used by all forces in Erathia."
msgstr "에라시아의 모든 군대가 흔히 사용하는, 잘 연마된 장검."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=812 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:812:Name"
msgid "Steel Broadsword"
msgstr "강철 브로드소드"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=812 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:812:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=812 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:812:Notes"
msgid "A fine Erathian steel broadsword of excellent quality and edge."
msgstr "뛰어난 품질과 날카로움을 자랑하는 정교한 에라티아 강철 브로드소드."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=813 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:813:Name"
msgid "Master Broadsword"
msgstr "달인의 브로드소드"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=813 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:813:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=813 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:813:Notes"
msgid "More a falchion than a broadsword, this magnificent weapon retains a keen edge in spite of its age."
msgstr "브로드소드라기보다는 팔치온에 더 가까운 이 웅장한 무기는 오랜 세월에도 불구하고 여전히 날카로운 날을 간직하고 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=814 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:814:Name"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=814 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:814:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=814 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:814:Notes"
msgid "The swept-back style of the cutlass helps opponents underestimate the weapon's true reach.  Many unexperienced swordsmen have lost their lives to this deceptive design."
msgstr "커틀러스의 뒤로 젖혀진 형태는 상대방이 무기의 실제 사정거리를 과소평가하게 만듭니다. 많은 미숙한 검객들이 이러한 기만적인 디자인에 속아 목숨을 잃었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=815 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:815:Name"
msgid "Goblin Cutlass"
msgstr "고블린 커틀러스"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=815 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:815:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=815 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:815:Notes"
msgid "A strange mix of brass and some other, reddish metal provide this weapon with its strange color and unusual strength.  Goblin craftsman are typically unconcerned with appearance, but when it comes to killing, they can be counted on to get it right.  "
msgstr "황동과 다른 붉은색 금속이 기묘하게 섞여 만들어진 이 무기는 독특한 색깔과 비범한 강도를 지니고 있다. 고블린 장인들은 일반적으로 외형에는 신경 쓰지 않지만, 살육에 있어서는 누구보다 정확한 솜씨를 발휘한다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=816 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:816:Name"
msgid "Exquisite Cutlass"
msgstr "정교한 커틀러스"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=816 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:816:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=816 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:816:Notes"
msgid "Cleverly concealed initials near the pommel of this cutlass prove this beautiful weapon to be the work of Alec Teling, master smith to Hareck IX, Lord of Regna, and emperor of the Endless Ocean."
msgstr "이 커틀러스의 손잡이 근처에 교묘하게 숨겨진 이니셜은 이 아름다운 무기가 레그나의 군주이자 끝없는 바다의 황제인 하렉 9세의 수석 대장장이인 알렉 텔링의 작품임을 증명합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=817 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:817:Name"
msgid "Improvised Dagger"
msgstr "급조한 단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=817 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:817:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=817 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:817:Notes"
msgid "A crude dagger found in the hands of thieves and ruffians everywhere."
msgstr "도적과 불량배들의 손에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 조잡한 단검."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=818 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:818:Name"
msgid "Dwarven Dagger"
msgstr "드워프 단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=818 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:818:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=818 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:818:Notes"
msgid "More like a short sword to a dwarf, this dagger is an excellent example of superior dwarven engineering and inferior artistic creativity."
msgstr "드워프에게는 짧은 검에 더 가까운 이 단검은 뛰어난 드워프 공학 기술과 부족한 예술적 창의성이 결합된 훌륭한 예입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=819 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:819:Name"
msgid "Sharktooth Dagger"
msgstr "상어 이빨 단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=819 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:819:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=819 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:819:Notes"
msgid "The 'blade' of this dagger is really a sharks' tooth taken from the waters of the Quiet Ocean and mounted on a fancy handle.  It is very sharp and light."
msgstr "이 단검의 '날'은 사실 고요한 바다에서 건져 올린 상어 이빨을 화려한 손잡이에 붙인 것입니다. 아주 날카롭고 가볍습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=81 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:81:Name"
msgid "Priestly Staff"
msgstr "사제의 지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=81 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:81:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=81 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:81:Notes"
msgid "This finely decorated staff is the product of Lizardman craft. Wrapped with exotic leathers, and ended with a bronze footcap and striker, these staves are carried by Lizardman priests as a symbol of station."
msgstr "정교하게 장식된 이 지팡이는 도마뱀 인간의 수공예품입니다. 이국적인 가죽으로 감싸고 청동으로 만든 받침과 타격봉으로 마감된 이 지팡이는 도마뱀 인간 사제들이 신분의 상징으로 지니고 다닙니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=820 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:820:Name"
msgid "Assassin's Dagger"
msgstr "암살자의 단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=820 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:820:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=820 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:820:Notes"
msgid "The crosspiece of this dagger folds in to make concealment easier.  A spring in the pommel snaps the crosspiece out very quietly when the dagger is drawn from its sheath."
msgstr "이 단검의 가로대는 접을 수 있어 휴대가 간편합니다. 칼자루 끝에 있는 스프링이 단검을 칼집에서 뽑을 때 가로대를 아주 조용하게 펴줍니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=821 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:821:Name"
msgid "Wonder Dagger"
msgstr "경이로운 단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=821 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:821:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=821 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:821:Notes"
msgid "A weapon from the Time of Wonders, it is no longer possible to achieve a sharper or stronger edge."
msgstr "경이의 시대에 만들어진 이 단검은, 이보다 더 날카롭거나 더 강인한 날을 가진 무기를 만들 수 없을 정도로 뛰어납니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=822 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:822:Name"
msgid "Shoddy Long Dagger"
msgstr "조잡한 장단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=822 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:822:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Long Dagger"
msgstr "장단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=822 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:822:Notes"
msgid "The long dagger combines the extra reach of the sword with the stealth of the dagger."
msgstr "긴 단검은 검의 긴 사거리와 단검의 은밀한 휴대성을 결합한 무기입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=823 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:823:Name"
msgid "Erathian Long Dagger"
msgstr "에라시아 장단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=823 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:823:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Long Dagger"
msgstr "장단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=823 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:823:Notes"
msgid "This long dagger is outwardly reminescent of the smaller Erathian daggers made using shark teeth, but its edge is unmistakably steel. The construction is sturdy and reliable and the blade is every bit as deadly as the shark tooth -- except it holds an edge better and is easier to resharpen."
msgstr "이 긴 단검은 겉모습은 상어 이빨로 만든 작은 에라스 단검을 연상시키지만, 날은 누가 봐도 강철로 만들어졌습니다. 견고하고 믿을 수 있는 구조에, 칼날은 상어 이빨만큼이나 치명적입니다. 게다가 날카로움을 더 오래 유지하고 다시 날카롭게 갈기도 더 쉽습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=824 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:824:Name"
msgid "Exquisite Long Dagger"
msgstr "정교한 장단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=824 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:824:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Long Dagger"
msgstr "장단검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=824 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:824:Notes"
msgid "The spare, yet appealing design of this long dagger is typical of pre-Silence artifacts.  This particular style was very popular at the time, but since more than a thousand years have passed, few remain.  Like everything from the time of the Silence, it looks as new as the day it was made."
msgstr "이 긴 단검의 간결하면서도 매력적인 디자인은 침묵의 시대 이전 유물의 전형적인 특징을 보여줍니다. 이러한 양식은 당시 매우 인기가 있었지만, 천 년이 넘는 세월이 흐르면서 현재는 거의 남아 있지 않습니다. 침묵의 시대 이전의 모든 유물처럼, 이 단검 또한 만들어진 날처럼 새것처럼 보입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=825 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:825:Name"
msgid "Crude Axe"
msgstr "조잡한 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=825 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:825:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=825 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:825:Notes"
msgid "This primitive axe is more like a simple tool than a weapon."
msgstr "이 원시적인 도끼는 무기라기보다는 단순한 도구에 더 가깝다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=826 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:826:Name"
msgid "Battle Axe"
msgstr "전투 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=826 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:826:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=826 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:826:Notes"
msgid "The flared edge of the blade is a common style used by low budget human armies and bandits."
msgstr "칼날 끝이 넓게 퍼진 형태는 저예산 인간 군대나 산적들이 흔히 사용하는 스타일입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=827 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:827:Name"
msgid "Dwarven Axe"
msgstr "드워프 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=827 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:827:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=827 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:827:Notes"
msgid "Typical Dwarven manufacture:  Strong, practical, and plain."
msgstr "전형적인 드워프 제품: 튼튼하고 실용적이며 단순하다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=828 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:828:Name"
msgid "Steel Axe"
msgstr "강철 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=828 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:828:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=828 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:828:Notes"
msgid "One of several crates full of such axes stolen from the Dwarves by the Warlocks of Nighon.  Each of these weapons has been tempered and enchanted by the Stone City foundry, and stamped with their mark."
msgstr "나이곤의 마법사들이 드워프들에게서 훔쳐온 도끼가 가득 담긴 상자 여러 개 중 하나입니다. 이 무기들은 모두 스톤 시티의 주조소에서 단련되고 마법이 부여되었으며, 그들의 표식이 새겨져 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=829 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:829:Name"
msgid "Minotaur Axe"
msgstr "미노타우로스 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=829 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:829:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=829 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:829:Notes"
msgid "Double bladed axes like these are powerfully enchanted by Minotaur sorcerers in a secret process known only to them.  These axes are light where they should be heavy, and slice through metal armor as easily as they slice through cloth."
msgstr "이와 같은 양날 도끼는 미노타우로스 마법사들이 자신들만이 아는 비밀스러운 마법으로 강력하게 강화한 것이다. 이 도끼는 무거워야 할 부분이 가벼워 금속 갑옷은 물론 천도 쉽게 베어낸다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=82 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:82:Name"
msgid "Serpent Staff"
msgstr "뱀 지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=82 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:82:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=82 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:82:Notes"
msgid "These rare staffs may appear unwieldy, but they are the product of sorcery. In combat they flex with animal intelligence to work in blows through their targets' defenses."
msgstr "이 희귀한 지팡이들은 다루기 힘들어 보일지 모르지만, 마법의 산물입니다. 전투에서 이 지팡이들은 동물적인 지력으로 휘둘러지며 목표물의 방어를 뚫고 일격을 가합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=830 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:830:Name"
msgid "Poleaxe"
msgstr "장대도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=830 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:830:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "양손 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=830 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:830:Notes"
msgid "This style of long hafted axe has better reach and more power than the normal one-handed axe."
msgstr "자루가 긴 이러한 형태의 도끼는 일반적인 한 손 도끼보다 사정거리가 길고 위력이 더 강합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=831 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:831:Name"
msgid "Warrior's Poleaxe"
msgstr "전사의 장대도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=831 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:831:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "양손 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=831 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:831:Notes"
msgid "This poleaxe has a sharper blade equipped with all the latest in military technology:  Blood grooves, whistle-holes, and a counterbalanced, smaller blade behind the haft for tricky, disembowling, backstrokes."
msgstr "이 폴액스는 최신 군사 기술이 모두 적용된 더욱 날카로운 날을 가지고 있습니다. 혈흔 홈, 호루라기 구멍, 그리고 교묘한 백스트로크와 같은 공격 기술을 위해 자루 뒤쪽에 균형을 잡아주는 작은 날이 장착되어 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=832 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:832:Name"
msgid "Headsman's Poleaxe"
msgstr "참수자의 장대도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=832 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:832:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "양손 도끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=832 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:832:Notes"
msgid "So named for the execution device favored by headsmen, the Headsman's Poleaxe sports a longer blade to reduce messy and embarassing execution mistakes.  "
msgstr "사형 집행인들이 선호하는 처형 도구에서 이름을 따온 참수자의 장대도끼는 처형 과정에서 발생하는 지저분하고 당황스러운 실수를 줄이기 위해 더 긴 날을 가지고 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=833 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:833:Name"
msgid "Crude Spear"
msgstr "조잡한 창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=833 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:833:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=833 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:833:Notes"
msgid "Though constructed with a head of sharpened rock lashed to a rough stick, this spear can cause serious damage. (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr "뾰족하게 다듬은 돌을 거친 막대기에 묶어 만든 창이지만, 이 창은 심각한 피해를 입힐 수 있습니다. (+1D9, 양손으로 사용할 경우 추가 피해)"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=834 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:834:Name"
msgid "Soldier's spear"
msgstr "병사의 창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=834 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:834:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=834 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:834:Notes"
msgid "Spears like this are found in all armies where their versatility as both pole and melee weapons are demonstrated regulary."
msgstr "이러한 창은 모든 군대에서 찾아볼 수 있으며, 장대 무기와 근접 무기로서의 다재다능함이 꾸준히 입증되고 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=835 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:835:Name"
msgid "Elven Spear"
msgstr "엘프 창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=835 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:835:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=835 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:835:Notes"
msgid "Elven weapons are almost always as graceful as they are practical.  The spear's style and elegance have not come at the expense of practical qualities such as the sturdy attachement of head to haft, nor the choices of metal and haft grip."
msgstr "엘프의 무기는 거의 항상 실용적이면서도 우아합니다. 창의 스타일과 우아함은 창날과 자루의 견고한 결합이나 금속 재질 및 손잡이 선택과 같은 실용적인 측면을 희생시키지 않고 얻어낸 것입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=836 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:836:Name"
msgid "Cruel Spear"
msgstr "잔혹한 창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=836 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:836:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=836 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:836:Notes"
msgid "The triangular shape of the spear head leads to especially painful wounds that do not heal easily or well.  Runic enchantments inscribed along the haft suggest enchantments that enhance the cruel effect of the triangular head."
msgstr "창끝의 삼각형 모양은 특히 고통스러운 상처를 남기며, 그 상처는 쉽게 아물지 않는다. 자루에 새겨진 룬 문자는 삼각형 창끝의 잔혹한 효과를 증폭시키는 마법이 걸려 있음을 암시한다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=837 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:837:Name"
msgid "Sublime Spear"
msgstr "숭고한 창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=837 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:837:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=837 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:837:Notes"
msgid "A smithy symbol and date stamp indicate this spear was made in the magical forges of Governor Padish 12 years before the Silence."
msgstr "대장간 상징과 날짜 스탬프는 이 창이 침묵의 시대가 시작되기 12년 전에 패디쉬 총독의 마법 대장간에서 만들어졌음을 나타냅니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=838 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:838:Name"
msgid "Old Halberd"
msgstr "낡은 미늘창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=838 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:838:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=838 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:838:Notes"
msgid "Like all Halberds, this weapon is basically an axe with a very long haft.  It's a versatile weapon--doubling as a spear when fighting room is tight, or a staff when personal defense is needed.  This one is of ordinary worksmanship and materials."
msgstr "모든 할버드와 마찬가지로, 이 무기는 기본적으로 자루가 매우 긴 도끼입니다. 공간이 좁을 때는 창처럼, 자기 방어가 필요할 때는 지팡이처럼 사용할 수 있는 다용도 무기입니다. 이 할버드는 제작 솜씨와 재료가 평범한 수준입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=839 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:839:Name"
msgid "Weighted Halberd"
msgstr "무게추 달린 미늘창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=839 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:839:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=839 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:839:Notes"
msgid "The haft of this halberd has been cored, and filled with a lead rod.  When the weapon is swung, the lead rod slides to the blade end of the halberd with a loud crack, adding force and weight to the blow."
msgstr "이 미늘창의 자루는 속을 파내고 그 안에 납 막대를 채워 넣었습니다. 미늘창을 휘두르면 납 막대가 큰 소리와 함께 날끝으로 미끄러져 들어가면서 타격에 힘과 무게를 더합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=83 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:83:Name"
msgid "Bone Staff"
msgstr "뼈 지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=83 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:83:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=83 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:83:Notes"
msgid "Fashioned from the spinal bones of wyverns and crowned by a dragon's lower spikeplate, these staves are the product of necromantic weaponcraft. It is unusual to find one of these deadly weapons that is not also carrying a powerful enchantment."
msgstr "와이번의 척추뼈로 만들어지고 용의 하단 가시판으로 장식된 이 지팡이는 강령술 무기 제작의 산물입니다. 이러한 치명적인 무기 중 강력한 마법이 걸려 있지 않은 것을 찾는 것은 드문 일입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=840 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:840:Name"
msgid "Mighty Halberd"
msgstr "강력한 미늘창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=840 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:840:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=840 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:840:Notes"
msgid "A small stamp on the blade of this weapon indicates it was constructed in the famous Mekorig Foundry by the master himself, Mekorig the Blind.  You would be hard pressed to find a finer Halberd anywhere in the world "
msgstr "이 무기의 칼날에 새겨진 작은 각인은 이 무기가 유명한 메코리그 주조소에서 거장 장님 메코리그 본인에 의해 제작되었음을 나타냅니다. 세계 어디에서도 이보다 더 훌륭한 할버드를 찾기는 어려울 것입니다. "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=841 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:841:Name"
msgid "Crude Trident"
msgstr "조잡한 삼지창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=841 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:841:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=841 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:841:Notes"
msgid "A variant of the farmer's pitchfork, the trident had been used by spear fishermen since time began.  Now it is the traditional weapon of sea-going warriors throughout the world."
msgstr "농부들이 쓰던 쇠스랑의 변형인 삼지창은 태초부터 작살 어부들이 사용해 왔습니다. 지금은 전 세계 해상 전사들의 전통 무기가 되었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=842 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:842:Name"
msgid "Barbed Trident"
msgstr "가시 삼지창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=842 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:842:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=842 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:842:Notes"
msgid "Improving on the basic trident design, the tips of the tines have rough, backwards facing barbs.  This designs causes much more damage as the weapon is pulled from the victim."
msgstr "기본적인 삼지창 디자인을 개선하여, 날끝에는 거칠고 뒤쪽으로 향한 가시가 달려 있습니다. 이러한 디자인은 삼지창을 뽑아낼 때 훨씬 더 큰 피해를 입힙니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=843 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:843:Name"
msgid "War Trident"
msgstr "전쟁용 삼지창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=843 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:843:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=843 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:843:Notes"
msgid "A style favored by the Imerial Regnan Navy, the two side tines of the war trident are thin and sharp to make slashing as easy as stabbing.  To further impress enemies, the tines are gilded in brass, and the haft painted yellow, giving the appearance that the Regnans are fighting with golden weapons."
msgstr "제국 해군이 선호했던 양식인 이 삼지창은 양쪽 날이 가늘고 날카로워 베는 것만큼이나 찌르는 것도 쉬웠습니다. 적에게 더욱 위압감을 주기 위해 날은 황동으로 도금하고 자루는 노란색으로 칠하여 마치 금으로 만든 무기로 싸우는 듯한 인상을 주었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=844 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:844:Name"
msgid "Crude Bow"
msgstr "조잡한 활"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=844 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:844:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=844 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:844:Notes"
msgid "A simple longbow constructed of common materials and uninspired design."
msgstr "흔한 재료로 만들어졌고 디자인이 평범한 단순한 장궁."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=845 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:845:Name"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=845 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:845:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=845 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:845:Notes"
msgid "A higher quality long bow designed after the elven long bow, but without the elven skill."
msgstr "엘프의 장궁을 본떠 만든 고급 장궁이지만, 엘프의 기술은 빠져 있다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=846 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:846:Name"
msgid "Elven Longbow"
msgstr "엘프 장궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=846 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:846:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=846 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:846:Notes"
msgid "Etched initials at the base of the bow indicate this bow was made by master bowyer Ivan Selving's workshop during the Timber Wars of the late 600's."
msgstr "활 밑부분에 새겨진 이니셜은 이 활이 600년대 후반 목재 전쟁 당시 명장 활 제작자 이반 셀빙의 작업장에서 만들어졌음을 나타냅니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=847 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:847:Name"
msgid "Composite Bow"
msgstr "합성 활"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=847 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:847:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=847 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:847:Notes"
msgid "Composite bows are made of a variety of materials and pieces, instead of a single piece of wood.  They are generally more flexible and powerful than regular bows."
msgstr "복합 활은 하나의 나무 조각이 아닌 다양한 재료와 조각으로 만들어집니다. 일반적으로 일반 활보다 유연하고 강력합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=848 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:848:Name"
msgid "Griffin Bow"
msgstr "그리핀 활"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=848 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:848:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=848 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:848:Notes"
msgid "The grisly materials used in this bow--a griffin's skull and tough spine--make for a surprisingly tough and powerful bow.  Needless to say, the materials are hard to harvest, and griffins fight back much harder than Yew trees."
msgstr "이 활에 사용된 섬뜩한 재료, 즉 그리핀의 두개골과 질긴 척추는 놀라울 정도로 단단하고 강력한 활을 만들어냅니다. 말할 것도 없이, 이 재료를 얻기는 어렵고, 그리핀은 주목나무보다 훨씬 더 강하게 저항합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=849 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:849:Name"
msgid "Crude Crossbow"
msgstr "조잡한 석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=849 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:849:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=849 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:849:Notes"
msgid "Although crossbows have many advantages--locking string catches, superior shot strength, easy to learn--they don't compare to the longbow when speed and range are critical.  "
msgstr "석궁은 활시위 고정 장치, 뛰어난 사격 강도, 쉬운 학습법 등 여러 장점이 있지만, 속도와 사거리가 중요한 경우에는 장궁에 미치지 못합니다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=84 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:84:Name"
msgid "Leather Jerkin"
msgstr "가죽 상의"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=84 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:84:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=84 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:84:Notes"
msgid "This armor of thick, supple leather studded with brass offers minimal protection against blows."
msgstr "두껍고 유연한 가죽에 황동 장식이 박힌 이 갑옷은 타격으로부터 최소한의 보호만 제공합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=850 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:850:Name"
msgid "Heavy Crossbow"
msgstr "중량 석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=850 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:850:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=850 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:850:Notes"
msgid "These crossbows were stockpiled by Archibald just prior to the Succession War for use against his brother.  As with most decisions involving death, Archibald chose wisely.  These crossbows are amongst the best in the land."
msgstr "이 석궁들은 아치볼드가 계승 전쟁 직전에 동생을 상대로 사용하기 위해 비축해 둔 것이다. 죽음과 관련된 대부분의 결정처럼, 아치볼드는 현명한 선택을 했다. 이 석궁들은 이 땅에서 가장 뛰어난 성능을 자랑하는 무기들이다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=851 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:851:Name"
msgid "Ideal Crossbow"
msgstr "이상적인 석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=851 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:851:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=851 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:851:Notes"
msgid "This is as much a crossbow as it is a work of art -- a sculpture of a dark figure with curved horns for bowstaves. It would be less surprising if it were indeed just a decoration, but it has all the mechanical parts it needs, cleverly worked into the wooden frame. Its origins are unknown, though it is safe to assume it's a product of dark sorcery, and its performance matches its appearance."
msgstr "이것은 예술 작품인 동시에 석궁이기도 하다. 굽은 뿔이 활대 역할을 하는 검은 형체의 조각상이다. 단순히 장식품이었다고 해도 이상할 건 없겠지만, 필요한 모든 기계 부품이 나무 틀에 교묘하게 내장되어 있다. 그 기원은 알 수 없지만, 어둠의 마법으로 만들어졌을 것이라고 추측할 수 있으며, 그 성능 또한 외형에 걸맞다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=852 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:852:Name"
msgid "Crude Mace"
msgstr "조잡한 철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=852 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:852:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=852 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:852:Notes"
msgid "Barely more sophisticated than a normal club, the mace is slightly more effective and much more durable."
msgstr "일반 곤봉보다 아주 조금 더 정교한 정도인 철퇴는 약간 더 효과적이고 훨씬 더 내구성이 뛰어납니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=853 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:853:Name"
msgid "Spiked Mace"
msgstr "가시 박힌 철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=853 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:853:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=853 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:853:Notes"
msgid "This weapon is designed to inflict good damage to both armored and unarmored opponents."
msgstr "이 무기는 갑옷을 입은 적과 입지 않은 적 모두에게 상당한 피해를 입히도록 설계되었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=854 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:854:Name"
msgid "Zealot Mace"
msgstr "광신도의 철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=854 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:854:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=854 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:854:Notes"
msgid "A common mace from Karigor, it displays the same superior quality of all weapons and equipment from that island."
msgstr "카리고르 섬에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 철퇴이지만, 그 섬의 모든 무기와 장비에서 볼 수 있듯이 뛰어난 품질을 자랑합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=855 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:855:Name"
msgid "Dwarven Morningstar"
msgstr "드워프 모닝스타"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=855 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:855:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=855 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:855:Notes"
msgid "A variation of the mace, the morningstar hits slower but much harder.  The spikes on the ball guarantee recipients will feel the blow, regardless of armor or hide."
msgstr "철퇴의 변형인 모닝스타는 공격 속도는 느리지만 훨씬 강력한 타격을 가합니다. 공 모양의 뾰족한 돌기들은 갑옷이나 가죽 종류에 관계없이 받는 이에게 확실한 타격감을 선사합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=856 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:856:Name"
msgid "Supreme Flail"
msgstr "최상급 도리깨"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=856 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:856:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=856 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:856:Notes"
msgid "A heavier, more menacing weapon than a morningstar, flails are almost as dangerous to their wielder as they are to opponents.  Flails like this one are of the highest quality, thoroughly enchanted by the Warlock Guild of Nighon."
msgstr "모닝스타보다 더 무겁고 위협적인 무기인 플레일은 사용자에게도 상대방에게도 거의 100% 위험한 무기입니다. 이 플레일은 나이곤의 마법사 길드에서 철저하게 마법을 걸어 만든 최고급 무기입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=857 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:857:Name"
msgid "Makeshift Hammer"
msgstr "급조한 망치"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=857 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:857:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "망치"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=857 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:857:Notes"
msgid "A crude, tool-like weapon, this hammer includes a wrist chain to prevent it from dropping from your hand."
msgstr "투박하고 도구 같은 무기인 이 망치에는 손에서 떨어지지 않도록 손목에 묶는 사슬이 달려 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=858 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:858:Name"
msgid "Battle Hammer"
msgstr "전투용 망치"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=858 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:858:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "망치"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=858 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:858:Notes"
msgid "This relatively simple hammer's greatest advantages are its low striking area due to the size of the head, and the spike on the reverse which could be used to inflict rather nasty wounds."
msgstr "이 비교적 단순한 망치의 가장 큰 장점은 머리 부분이 작아 타격 면적이 작다는 점과 뒷면에 뾰족한 부분이 있어 상당히 심한 상처를 입힐 수 있다는 점입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=859 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:859:Name"
msgid "Dwarven Hammer"
msgstr "드워프 망치"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=859 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:859:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "망치"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=859 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:859:Notes"
msgid "The top of the line for the hammer family of weapons.  This Dwarven hammer was constructed in the forges of Stone City, and every feature is perfect--balance, weight, handle material, head construction--all the best possible with modern metalurgical techniques."
msgstr "망치 계열 무기 중 최고급 모델입니다. 이 드워프 망치는 스톤 시티의 대장간에서 제작되었으며, 균형, 무게, 손잡이 재질, 망치 머리 구조 등 모든 면에서 현대 금속 가공 기술로 가능한 최고의 품질을 자랑합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=85 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:85:Name"
msgid "Hardened Leather Vest"
msgstr "강화 가죽 조끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=85 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:85:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=85 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:85:Notes"
msgid "This item of leather armor has been hardened to offer increased protection. It is comfortable and light though offers little coverage."
msgstr "이 가죽 갑옷은 강화된 보호 기능을 제공하기 위해 제작되었습니다. 착용감이 편안하고 가볍지만, 신체 전체를 덮어주는 범위는 좁습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=860 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:860:Name"
msgid "Primitive Club"
msgstr "원시적인 곤봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=860 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:860:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "곤봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=860 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:860:Notes"
msgid "A primitive weapon usable by even the stupidest of monsters.  This club is constructed of Erathian oak."
msgstr "가장 멍청한 괴물조차도 사용할 수 있는 원시적인 무기. 이 곤봉은 에라티아 참나무로 만들어졌다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=861 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:861:Name"
msgid "Thorned Club"
msgstr "가시 곤봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=861 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:861:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "곤봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=861 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:861:Notes"
msgid "This small club has been fitted with sharp, thorn-like spikes that somewhat make up for its compact size."
msgstr "이 작은 곤봉에는 날카롭고 가시 같은 뾰족한 돌기가 달려 있어, 작은 크기를 어느 정도 보완해 줍니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=862 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:862:Name"
msgid "Steel Club"
msgstr "강철 곤봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=862 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:862:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "곤봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=862 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:862:Notes"
msgid "The symmetry and length of the knob at the end of the club is the only feature that distinguishes this club from a mace.  The balance is good, the construction is solid, but it IS still a club, and you can't expect that much from it.  Probably of Goblin manufacture."
msgstr "곤봉 끝부분의 대칭성과 길이만이 이 곤봉을 철퇴와 구별하는 유일한 특징입니다. 균형감도 좋고 만듦새도 견고하지만, 어쨌든 곤봉일 뿐이니 너무 많은 것을 기대할 수는 없겠죠. 아마도 고블린이 만든 것 같습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=863 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:863:Name"
msgid "Simple Staff"
msgstr "간소한 지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=863 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:863:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=863 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:863:Notes"
msgid "The staff is the common weapon of the oppressed."
msgstr "지팡이는 억압받는 자들의 흔한 무기이다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=864 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:864:Name"
msgid "Iron Core Staff"
msgstr "철심 지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=864 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:864:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=864 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:864:Notes"
msgid "This staff has been filled with iron to give a harder punch than an ordinary staff, while appearing to be nothing more than a fancy walking stick.  The wood is polished Ash, carved with a tasteful design."
msgstr "이 지팡이는 일반 지팡이보다 더 강력한 타격을 주기 위해 철이 채워져 있지만, 겉보기에는 그저 멋진 지팡이처럼 보입니다. 나무는 윤이 나는 물푸레나무로 만들어졌으며, 세련된 디자인으로 조각되어 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=865 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:865:Name"
msgid "Wizard Staff"
msgstr "마법사의 지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=865 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:865:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=865 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:865:Notes"
msgid "A weird combination of wood, glass and aluminum form the staff, while a crystalline skull tops it.  The whole weapon is bound together with glue and strong enchantments to make one of the lightest, strongest staves in the world."
msgstr "나무, 유리, 알루미늄이 기묘하게 조합되어 지팡이를 이루고, 그 꼭대기에는 수정 해골이 얹혀 있다. 이 무기 전체는 접착제와 강력한 마법으로 단단히 결합되어 세상에서 가장 가볍고 강한 지팡이 중 하나를 만들어냈다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=866 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:866:Name"
msgid "Blaster"
msgstr "블래스터"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=866 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:866:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ancient Weapon"
msgstr "고대 무기"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=866 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:866:Notes"
msgid "A weapon of awesome power, almost certainly created during the Time of Wonders."
msgstr "엄청난 위력을 지닌 무기로, 거의 틀림없이 경이의 시대에 만들어졌을 것이다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=867 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:867:Name"
msgid "Blaster Rifle"
msgstr "블래스터 소총"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=867 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:867:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ancient Weapon"
msgstr "고대 무기"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=867 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:867:Notes"
msgid "The finest of personal weapons made during the Time of Wonders, Blaster Rifles can deal death faster than any weapon you have ever seen."
msgstr "경이의 시대에 만들어진 최고의 개인 화기인 블래스터 소총은 당신이 지금까지 본 어떤 무기보다도 빠르게 적을 처치할 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=868 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:868:Name"
msgid "Crude Leather Armor"
msgstr "조잡한 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=868 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:868:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=868 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:868:Notes"
msgid "Leather armor is the lightest and most easily worn armor, but it offers less protection that the heavier armors.  The leather in this suit was improperly cured and still stinks of the chemicals used in its production."
msgstr "가죽 갑옷은 가장 가볍고 착용하기 쉬운 갑옷이지만, 무거운 갑옷에 비해 보호력이 떨어집니다. 이 갑옷에 사용된 가죽은 제대로 가공되지 않아 제조 과정에서 사용된 화학 물질 냄새가 여전히 진동합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=869 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:869:Name"
msgid "Studded Leather"
msgstr "징 박힌 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=869 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:869:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=869 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:869:Notes"
msgid "This suit of leather armor is held together with bronze studs instead of leather straps.  This construction makes it a bit stronger, but also a bit heavier."
msgstr "이 가죽 갑옷은 가죽 끈 대신 청동 못으로 고정되어 있습니다. 이러한 구조 덕분에 내구성은 다소 뛰어나지만 무게도 약간 더 나갑니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=86 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:86:Name"
msgid "Caravaner's Leather"
msgstr "대상단원의 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=86 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:86:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=86 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:86:Notes"
msgid "This is the type of armor worn most often by those guarding Alverian merchant caravans. A hardened and internally braced breastplate covers an undersuit of tough but supple hide, offering the wearer full body protection with a minimal hampering of movement."
msgstr "이 갑옷은 알바르 상인 대상 행렬을 호위하는 사람들이 가장 흔히 착용하는 종류입니다. 단단하고 내부 보강재가 있는 흉갑은 질기면서도 유연한 가죽으로 만든 속옷을 감싸고 있어, 착용자에게 전신 보호 기능을 제공하면서도 움직임을 최소한으로 제한합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=870 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:870:Name"
msgid "Officer's Leather"
msgstr "장교의 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=870 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:870:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=870 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:870:Notes"
msgid "An otherwise ordinary suit of leather armor, this suit is imbued with a subtle enchantment that strengthens the material against blows without increasing weight."
msgstr "겉보기엔 평범한 가죽 갑옷이지만, 이 갑옷에는 무게를 늘리지 않으면서도 타격에 대한 내구성을 강화하는 미묘한 마법이 깃들어 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=871 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:871:Name"
msgid "Light Dragon Leather"
msgstr "경량 드래곤 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=871 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:871:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=871 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:871:Notes"
msgid "Standard issue leather armor for officers in the Regnan Navy.  All such leather armor receives enchantments to strengthen and lighten it during its creation in the Regnan Armories."
msgstr "레그나 해군 장교용 표준 가죽 갑옷입니다. 모든 가죽 갑옷은 레그나 무기고에서 제작될 때 강도와 경량화를 강화하는 마법이 부여됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=872 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:872:Name"
msgid "Royal Leather"
msgstr "왕실 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=872 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:872:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=872 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:872:Notes"
msgid "Only a few suits like this one have been made, and all were special orders for members of the royal family of Erathia--the Gryphonhearts.  This one had to come from one of three places:  Stolen from the palace armory, taken on the battlefield, or robbed from a grave."
msgstr "이와 같은 갑옷은 극소수만 제작되었으며, 모두 에라시아 왕족인 그리폰하트 가문의 특별 주문품이었다. 이 갑옷은 세 가지 경로 중 하나에서 유래했을 것이다. 궁궐 무기고에서 훔쳤거나, 전장에서 노획했거나, 아니면 무덤에서 도굴당했을 것이다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=873 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:873:Name"
msgid "Disheveled Chain Mail"
msgstr "낡은 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=873 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:873:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=873 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:873:Notes"
msgid "Chain mail is an armor formed of small, interlocking loops of metal.  It looks like someone forgot to oil the rings, or maybe left it out in the rain because rust has begun to form in the armpits and under the collars."
msgstr "사슬 갑옷은 작은 금속 고리들이 서로 맞물려 만들어진 갑옷입니다. 마치 누군가 고리에 기름칠을 하는 것을 잊었거나, 비를 맞은 것처럼 겨드랑이와 깃 아래 부분에 녹이 슬기 시작했습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=874 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:874:Name"
msgid "Quality Steel Chain Mail"
msgstr "고급 강철 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=874 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:874:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=874 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:874:Notes"
msgid "This suit of chain mail is made of steel and is actually lighter than similar suits made of plain iron.  Thin rings were used in its construction, but the steel composition makes them very strong."
msgstr "이 사슬 갑옷은 강철로 만들어졌으며, 실제로 일반 철로 만든 비슷한 갑옷보다 가볍습니다. 얇은 고리가 사용되었지만, 강철 재질 덕분에 매우 튼튼합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=875 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:875:Name"
msgid "Fine Chain Mail"
msgstr "고급 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=875 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:875:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=875 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:875:Notes"
msgid "Very high quality steel is reinforced with fine studded leather to soften blows while minimizing weight.  The leather portions are quite artistic and pleasing to the eye."
msgstr "최고급 강철 프레임에 섬세한 가죽 스터드를 덧대어 충격을 완화하는 동시에 무게를 최소화했습니다. 가죽 부분은 예술적인 디자인으로 시각적인 아름다움을 더합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=876 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:876:Name"
msgid "Resplendent Chain Mail"
msgstr "찬란한 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=876 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:876:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=876 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:876:Notes"
msgid "A distinctive suit of armor meant to aid recognition of officers during battle.  Besides just looking good, the armor is amongst the lightest, most supple chain mail available.  "
msgstr "전투 중 장교를 쉽게 알아볼 수 있도록 고안된 독특한 갑옷입니다. 보기에도 좋을 뿐만 아니라, 현존하는 사슬 갑옷 중 가장 가볍고 유연한 갑옷에 속합니다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=877 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:877:Name"
msgid "Golden Chain Mail"
msgstr "황금 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=877 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:877:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=877 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:877:Notes"
msgid "A very rare suit of armor turned out by the Heavenly Forges of Governor Padish before the Silence.  The armor was originally worn strictly by the Governor's highest military officers as a badge of office.  It is not just for show; this chain mail is lighter, stronger, and more supple than any other chain in the world."
msgstr "침묵의 시대 이전에 파디쉬 총독의 천상 대장간에서 제작된 매우 희귀한 갑옷입니다. 이 갑옷은 원래 총독의 최고위 군사 장교들만이 직위를 상징하는 표식으로 착용했습니다. 단순한 장식이 아닙니다. 이 사슬 갑옷은 세상의 어떤 사슬보다 가볍고 강하며 유연합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=878 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:878:Name"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=878 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:878:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=878 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:878:Notes"
msgid "Plate armor is the strongest armor available.  It is much heavier than other suits of armor, and requires considerable practice to get used to wearing.  This suit is made of iron, and the workmanship is unremarkable."
msgstr "판금 갑옷은 현존하는 갑옷 중 가장 튼튼합니다. 다른 갑옷보다 훨씬 무겁기 때문에 착용에 익숙해지려면 상당한 연습이 필요합니다. 이 갑옷은 철로 만들어졌으며, 제작 솜씨는 특별히 뛰어나지 않습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=879 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:879:Name"
msgid "Splendid Plate Armor"
msgstr "화려한 판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=879 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:879:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=879 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:879:Notes"
msgid "Forged in an Erathian armory, this suit of plate armor bears a recent stamp:  B.R., Steadwick Foundry, 1151.  The initials are those of Byron Rockermann, Royal armorsmith of Erathia.  His work is competent and elegant."
msgstr "에라시아의 무기고에서 제작된 이 판금 갑옷에는 최근에 찍힌 \"B.R., 스테드윅 주조소, 1151\"이라는 각인이 있습니다. 이 이니셜은 에라시아 왕실 갑옷 제작자인 바이런 로커만의 것입니다. 그의 솜씨는 훌륭하고 우아합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=87 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:87:Name"
msgid "Regnan Leather"
msgstr "레그나 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=87 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:87:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=87 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:87:Notes"
msgid "Though seemingly too thin to offer solid protection, this armor of Regnan design holds a subtle enchantment which makes the leather nearly steel tough. Additionally, a secret process makes the suit resistant to salt water corrosion."
msgstr "겉보기에는 너무 얇아서 제대로 된 보호력을 제공하지 못할 것 같지만, 레그나가 설계한 이 갑옷은 미묘한 마법이 걸려 있어 가죽이 거의 강철처럼 단단해집니다. 또한, 비밀 공정을 통해 염수 부식에도 강합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=880 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:880:Name"
msgid "Noble Plate Armor"
msgstr "귀족의 판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=880 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:880:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=880 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:880:Notes"
msgid "A suit of armor so fine could only have come from the forge of the Master himself--Mekorig the Blind.  Indeed, this one bears the initials of his son, Kasev Mekorig near the heel.  The joints move easily, and the metal has a curious triple plated construction that makes it thin and light, yet incredibly strong.  Padding in comfortable, too."
msgstr "이토록 정교한 갑옷은 오직 거장 장님 메코리그만이 만들 수 있었을 것이다. 실제로 이 갑옷의 발꿈치 부분에는 그의 아들 카세프 메코리그의 이니셜이 새겨져 있다. 관절은 부드럽게 움직이며, 금속은 특이한 삼중 도금 구조로 되어 있어 얇고 가벼우면서도 놀라울 정도로 견고하다. 안감 또한 편안하다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=881 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:881:Name"
msgid "Goblin Shield"
msgstr "고블린 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=881 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:881:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=881 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:881:Notes"
msgid "A simple, old shield with crude markings on its face.  Ugly, but practical."
msgstr "표면에 투박한 무늬가 새겨진 단순하고 낡은 방패. 못생겼지만 실용적이다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=882 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:882:Name"
msgid "Wooden Shield"
msgstr "나무 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=882 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:882:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=882 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:882:Notes"
msgid "This shield is made of wood framed by iron.  It is heavy, but well constructed and in good condition."
msgstr "이 방패는 철제 틀에 나무를 덧대어 만든 것입니다. 무겁긴 하지만 견고하게 제작되었고 상태도 좋습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=883 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:883:Name"
msgid "Horseman's Shield"
msgstr "기병의 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=883 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:883:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=883 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:883:Notes"
msgid "Narrow and tapered at the bottom, this shield is intended for battle on horseback, but will work just fine on foot.  Construction is tight and materials are tough--it should be able to resist a direct spear thrust."
msgstr "좁고 아래쪽으로 갈수록 가늘어지는 이 방패는 기마 전투용으로 제작되었지만, 도보 전투에서도 충분히 제 역할을 합니다. 견고한 구조와 내구성 있는 재질로 만들어져 창의 직격탄을 막아낼 수 있을 것입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=884 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:884:Name"
msgid "Sterling Shield"
msgstr "순은 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=884 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:884:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=884 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:884:Notes"
msgid "Made of a lightweight metal, this shield has a foundry stamp from the Kelebrim armory.  Though light, the material is very strong, and the metal is welded almost seamlessly.  "
msgstr "이 방패는 가벼운 금속으로 만들어졌으며, 켈레브림 무기고의 주조 도장이 찍혀 있습니다. 가볍지만 재질은 매우 견고하며, 금속은 거의 이음새 없이 용접되어 있습니다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=885 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:885:Name"
msgid "Phynaxian Shield"
msgstr "피낙시아 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=885 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:885:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=885 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:885:Notes"
msgid "These shields were forged by the Phynaxian empire during its brief rise to power on the steppes of southern Erathia (790-864).  They are made of stalt, a metal that takes well to enchantment, and contributed heavily to Phynaxian military might.  Unfortunately, very little of the metal could be mined, and Phynaxia fell in 864 A.S. to an Elvish offensive."
msgstr "이 방패들은 에라시아 남부 스텝 지역에서 짧은 기간 동안 세력을 확장했던 피낙시아 제국(790-864년)에 의해 제작되었습니다. 마법 부여에 적합한 금속인 스탈트로 만들어졌으며, 피낙시아의 군사력 증강에 크게 기여했습니다. 하지만 스탈트 채굴량이 매우 적었고, 결국 피낙시아는 864년 엘프의 공세에 함락되었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=886 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:886:Name"
msgid "Crude Buckler"
msgstr "조잡한 소형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=886 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:886:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=886 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:886:Notes"
msgid "A small wood buckler designed to protect against arrows without encumbering its wielder.  The quality is amaturish, but it's in good condition and will serve its purpose."
msgstr "화살로부터 몸을 보호하면서도 휴대가 부담스럽지 않도록 디자인된 작은 나무 방패입니다. 품질은 아마추어 수준이지만, 상태는 양호하며 제 역할을 충분히 해낼 것입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=887 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:887:Name"
msgid "Bronze Shield"
msgstr "청동 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=887 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:887:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=887 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:887:Notes"
msgid "Bronze shields are lighter than iron shields of the same size, but aren't nearly as strong. This particular one is of a slightly larger variety and has been reasonably well protected from rusting."
msgstr "청동 방패는 같은 크기의 철 방패보다 가볍지만, 강도는 훨씬 떨어집니다. 이 방패는 크기가 약간 더 큰 편이며, 녹이 슬지 않도록 비교적 잘 보존되어 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=888 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:888:Name"
msgid "Metal Shield"
msgstr "금속 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=888 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:888:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=888 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:888:Notes"
msgid "The pretty red design on the surface of this shield means it's from Deyja, and the paint isn't paint.  Emulsifiers and preservatives help to retain the original color…"
msgstr "이 방패 표면의 아름다운 붉은색 무늬는 데이자에서 만들어졌다는 것을 의미하며, 사용된 페인트는 단순한 페인트가 아닙니다. 유화제와 방부제가 원래 색상을 유지하는 데 도움을 줍니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=889 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:889:Name"
msgid "Alloyed Shield"
msgstr "합금 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=889 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:889:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=889 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:889:Notes"
msgid "The exact mixture of metals in these strong shields has been lost for hundreds of years.  Attempts to rediscover the process used to make them have been miserable failures.  There is absolutely nothing enchanted or magical about these shields--any enchantment they carry was added after they were created.  "
msgstr "이 강력한 방패에 사용된 금속의 정확한 배합 비율은 수백 년 동안 알려지지 않았습니다. 방패 제작 과정을 재발견하려는 시도는 번번이 실패로 돌아갔습니다. 이 방패에는 마법이나 주술적인 힘이 전혀 없으며, 만약 마법이 걸려 있다면 그것은 방패가 만들어진 후에 덧붙여진 것입니다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=88 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:88:Name"
msgid "Alvarian Leather"
msgstr "알바르 가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=88 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:88:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=88 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:88:Notes"
msgid "Leather armor sets of this quality are of the finest produced by the Alvarian Armorers' Guild. The stalt-alloy edged panels are virtually inpenetrable; their clever interlockings give the wearer excellent freedom of movement."
msgstr "이 최고급 가죽 갑옷은 알바르 갑옷 제작자 길드에서 생산하는 최상급 제품입니다. 강철 합금으로 마감된 패널은 사실상 뚫을 수 없으며, 정교한 맞물림 구조 덕분에 착용자는 탁월한 움직임의 자유를 누릴 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=890 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:890:Name"
msgid "Majestic Shield"
msgstr "장엄한 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=890 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:890:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=890 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:890:Notes"
msgid "The dark, golden color of these shields is actually a flaw.  About fifty of these shields were turned out by the Heavenly Forge as it began to fail.  Although imperfect, they are second only to shields built by the Forge in its prime."
msgstr "이 방패들의 어둡고 황금빛을 띠는 것은 사실 결함입니다. 천상의 대장간이 쇠퇴하기 시작했을 때 약 50개의 방패가 이러한 형태로 만들어졌습니다. 완벽하지는 않지만, 이 방패들은 대장간이 전성기에 만든 방패 다음으로 뛰어난 품질을 자랑합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=891 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:891:Name"
msgid "Horned Helm"
msgstr "뿔 달린 투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=891 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:891:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=891 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:891:Notes"
msgid "This cheap helm is better suited for a costume party than a battle.  The horns have been glued onto a rigid leather cap dyed black to make it look scarier.  The material is brittle and flaky, and will probably come apart at just the wrong time."
msgstr "이 싸구려 투구는 전투보다는 코스튬 파티에 더 어울립니다. 뿔은 뻣뻣한 가죽 모자에 붙여져 있고, 더 무섭게 보이도록 검게 염색되어 있습니다. 재질이 잘 부서지고 벗겨지기 쉬워서, 아마도 가장 위험한 순간에 떨어져 나갈 것 같습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=892 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:892:Name"
msgid "Conscript's Helm"
msgstr "징집병의 투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=892 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:892:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=892 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:892:Notes"
msgid "The simple style and uniformity of these helms is meant to strike terror into the hearts of enemies when they see row upon row of bronze, spiked helms marching toward them.  "
msgstr "이 투구들의 단순하고 통일된 스타일은, 청동으로 만든 뾰족한 투구들이 줄지어 적들을 향해 행진하는 모습을 볼 때 적들의 마음에 공포를 심어주기 위한 것입니다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=893 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:893:Name"
msgid "Elven Helm"
msgstr "엘프 투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=893 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:893:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=893 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:893:Notes"
msgid "This helm design has been used by the Elves of Erathia since before the Silence.  It is composed of silver and steel and is very strong."
msgstr "이 투구 디자인은 에라시아의 엘프들이 침묵의 시대 이전부터 사용해 온 것입니다. 은과 강철로 만들어져 매우 견고합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=894 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:894:Name"
msgid "Phynaxian Helm"
msgstr "피낙시아 투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=894 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:894:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=894 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:894:Notes"
msgid "Worn by Phynaxian Dragoons during the expansion of their empire a few hundred years ago, these helms are tough, flexible, and light.  They are made of two strips of dragonhide bound together with stalt metal studs."
msgstr "수백 년 전 피낙스 제국 확장기에 피낙스 용기병들이 착용했던 이 투구는 튼튼하고 유연하며 가볍습니다. 두 겹의 용가죽을 금속 못으로 엮어 만들었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=895 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:895:Name"
msgid "Mogred Helm"
msgstr "모그레드 투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=895 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:895:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=895 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:895:Notes"
msgid "Half made from the skull of the ferocious Mogred beast in Karigor, these helms grow more uncommon every year as the Mogreds approach extinction.  Two poisonous spines used to grow from the red spots on the front of the helm."
msgstr "카리고르에 사는 흉포한 모그레드 괴물의 두개골로 반쯤 만들어진 이 투구는 모그레드가 멸종 위기에 처함에 따라 해마다 점점 더 보기 드물어지고 있습니다. 투구 앞면의 붉은 반점에서는 예전에는 두 개의 독이 든 가시가 자라나 있었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=896 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:896:Name"
msgid "Peasant Hat"
msgstr "농민의 모자"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=896 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:896:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hat"
msgstr "모자"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=896 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:896:Notes"
msgid "A common, cloth hat with a feather stuck in the band to add a dash of style."
msgstr "평범한 천 모자에 밴드 부분에 깃털을 꽂아 스타일을 더한 것."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=897 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:897:Name"
msgid "Traveller's Hat"
msgstr "여행자의 모자"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=897 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:897:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hat"
msgstr "모자"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=897 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:897:Notes"
msgid "A simple hat meant to keep sun and dust off a traveller's head."
msgstr "여행자의 머리에 햇볕과 먼지가 닿지 않도록 하기 위한 간단한 모자."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=898 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:898:Name"
msgid "Fancy Hat"
msgstr "화려한 모자"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=898 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:898:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hat"
msgstr "모자"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=898 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:898:Notes"
msgid "The latest in fashion, this hat harkens back to more of a working class style.  It isn't really the hat that's in style, it's the working man that young nobles are trying to emulate--who in turn seeks to emulate the nobleman…"
msgstr "최신 유행인 이 모자는 오히려 노동자 계층의 스타일을 떠올리게 합니다. 유행하는 것은 모자 자체가 아니라, 젊은 귀족들이 흉내 내려는 노동자 계층의 모습이고, 그 노동자들은 또 귀족을 흉내 내려는 것입니다…"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=899 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:899:Name"
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "왕관"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=899 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:899:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "왕관"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=899 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:899:Notes"
msgid "This is a cheap crown of the sort that primitive goblins wear to mock human customs.  The metal is bronze, and the gem is made of glass."
msgstr "이것은 원시적인 고블린들이 인간의 풍습을 조롱하기 위해 쓰는 싸구려 왕관이다. 재질은 청동이고, 보석은 유리로 만들어졌다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=89 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:89:Name"
msgid "Rusty Mail Vest"
msgstr "녹슨 사슬 조끼"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=89 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:89:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chainmail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=89 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:89:Notes"
msgid "This corroded ring mail vest has seen better days. It has been field repaired in many places and even has a large patch of thinner mail salvaged from a piece of chain cowl."
msgstr "이 부식된 고리형 사슬 갑옷 조끼는 전성기를 훨씬 지났습니다. 여러 곳이 현장에서 수선되었고, 심지어 사슬 두건에서 떼어낸 얇은 사슬 조각을 덧붙인 부분도 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=8 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:8:Name"
msgid "Minotaur Battlesword"
msgstr "미노타우로스 전투검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=8 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:8:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=8 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:8:Notes"
msgid "Only those possessed of great strength and balance can gracefully swing these mighty blades let alone control them in the heat of combat."
msgstr "엄청난 힘과 균형 감각을 지닌 자만이 이 강력한 검을 우아하게 휘두를 수 있을 뿐 아니라, 전투의 열기 속에서 그것을 제어할 수 있다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=900 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:900:Name"
msgid "Noble Crown"
msgstr "귀족 왕관"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=900 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:900:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "왕관"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=900 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:900:Notes"
msgid "A fine, if somewhat ostentatious crown made with gold leaf and large, high quality amethysts.  It suits nobles of your station well."
msgstr "금박과 크고 질 좋은 자수정으로 장식된, 다소 화려하지만 훌륭한 왕관입니다. 귀족 여러분께 잘 어울립니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=901 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:901:Name"
msgid "Royal Crown"
msgstr "왕실 왕관"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=901 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:901:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "왕관"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=901 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:901:Notes"
msgid "Crowns such as this are what you might find adorning the heads of genuine royalty. Not only do they look elegant without being gaudy, but they're perfectly suited to taking the strongest of enchantments."
msgstr "이런 왕관은 진짜 왕족의 머리를 장식하는 것과 같은 모습입니다. 화려하지 않으면서도 우아해 보일 뿐만 아니라, 가장 강력한 마법에도 완벽하게 견딜 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=902 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:902:Name"
msgid "Leather Belt"
msgstr "가죽 허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=902 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:902:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=902 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:902:Notes"
msgid "A peasant's belt.  This one is made of poorly cured leather and rusting iron studs."
msgstr "농민의 허리띠. 이 허리띠는 제대로 가공되지 않은 가죽과 녹슨 철 못으로 만들어졌다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=903 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:903:Name"
msgid "Fine Belt"
msgstr "고급 허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=903 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:903:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=903 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:903:Notes"
msgid "A well crafted belt of well tanned leather and fine stitching.  The buckle is made of polished silver."
msgstr "잘 가공된 가죽과 정교한 바느질로 제작된 벨트입니다. 버클은 광택이 나는 은으로 만들어졌습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=904 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:904:Name"
msgid "Strong Belt"
msgstr "튼튼한 허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=904 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:904:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=904 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:904:Notes"
msgid "A tough, yet high quality leather belt.  This one was probably made in western Erathia.  "
msgstr "튼튼하면서도 품질 좋은 가죽 벨트입니다. 아마도 에라시아 서부에서 제작되었을 것입니다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=905 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:905:Name"
msgid "Silver Belt"
msgstr "은 허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=905 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:905:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=905 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:905:Notes"
msgid "A very nicely made silver belt, this one is old, but well cared for.  There's no trace of tarnish on any of the links--just a bit of wear around the buckle."
msgstr "아주 잘 만들어진 은 벨트입니다. 오래되었지만 관리가 잘 되어 있습니다. 벨트 고리에는 변색된 흔적이 전혀 없고, 버클 주변에만 약간의 마모가 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=906 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:906:Name"
msgid "Gilded Belt"
msgstr "금박 허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=906 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:906:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=906 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:906:Notes"
msgid "Gaudy to an extreme, this belt is made of solid 14-karat gold.  Each link has a different, low quality image stamped on its face.  Tasteless, but valuable."
msgstr "지나치게 화려한 이 벨트는 순금 14K로 만들어졌습니다. 각 링크에는 서로 다른 저품질 이미지가 새겨져 있습니다. 촌스럽지만 값비싼 물건입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=907 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:907:Name"
msgid "Fine Leather Cloak"
msgstr "고급 가죽 망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=907 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:907:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=907 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:907:Notes"
msgid "A simple traveller's cloak."
msgstr "단순한 여행자용 망토."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=908 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:908:Name"
msgid "Huntsman's Cloak"
msgstr "사냥꾼의 망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=908 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:908:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=908 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:908:Notes"
msgid "A huntsman's cloak colored green to make the wearer difficult to see in the forest.  Not much to look at, but it serves its purpose."
msgstr "사냥꾼의 망토는 숲 속에서 착용자가 눈에 띄지 않도록 녹색으로 염색되었다. 보기에는 그다지 좋지 않지만, 제 역할을 톡톡히 해낸다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=909 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:909:Name"
msgid "Ranger's Cloak"
msgstr "레인저의 망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=909 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:909:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=909 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:909:Notes"
msgid "Woven from plant fibers found in the Tularean Forest, these cloaks are the traditional garb of the Elven Rangers. This black variety is reserved for higher ranking Rangers and symbolizes their status as leaders."
msgstr "툴라레아 숲에서 자라는 식물 섬유로 짠 이 망토는 엘프 레인저들의 전통 의상입니다. 특히 이 검은색 망토는 고위 레인저들만을 위한 것으로, 그들의 지도자적 지위를 상징합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=90 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:90:Name"
msgid "Steel Chainmail"
msgstr "강철 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=90 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:90:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chainmail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=90 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:90:Notes"
msgid "Constructed of strong steel this is the type of armor worn by the rank and file foot soldiers of many armies."
msgstr "튼튼한 강철로 제작된 이 갑옷은 여러 군대의 일반 보병들이 착용하는 갑옷의 종류입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=910 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:910:Name"
msgid "Elegant Cloak"
msgstr "우아한 망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=910 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:910:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=910 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:910:Notes"
msgid "This cloak is of the quality preferred by wealthy nobles and royalty.  It is hard to find better."
msgstr "이 망토는 부유한 귀족과 왕족들이 선호하는 최고급 품질입니다. 이보다 더 좋은 망토를 찾기는 어려울 것입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=911 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:911:Name"
msgid "Glorious Cloak"
msgstr "영광의 망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=911 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:911:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=911 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:911:Notes"
msgid "Almost all cloaks like this one come with some sort of enchantment.  The Warlocks of Nighon employ legions of mentally enslaved people to perform the tedious weaving and ritual spell casting necessary to make these cloaks."
msgstr "이와 같은 망토는 거의 모두 어떤 형태로든 마법이 걸려 있습니다. 나이곤의 마법사들은 정신적으로 노예가 된 수많은 사람들을 동원하여 이러한 망토를 만드는 데 필요한 고된 직조 작업과 의식적인 주문 시전을 수행합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=912 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:912:Name"
msgid "Pinched Gauntlets"
msgstr "조이는 건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=912 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:912:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=912 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:912:Notes"
msgid "Low quality iron gauntlets with cloth linings to prevent blisters.  "
msgstr "물집 방지를 위해 천 안감을 댄 저품질 철제 장갑.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=913 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:913:Name"
msgid "Steel Gauntlets"
msgstr "강철 건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=913 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:913:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=913 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:913:Notes"
msgid "This pair of gauntlets is made of steel and decorated with brass tracery along the outside of the palm and back of the hand.  It is in good repair and well oiled."
msgstr "이 장갑 한 쌍은 강철로 만들어졌으며 손바닥 바깥쪽과 손등을 따라 황동 장식이 되어 있습니다. 상태가 양호하고 기름칠도 잘 되어 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=914 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:914:Name"
msgid "Silver Mesh Gauntlets"
msgstr "은망 건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=914 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:914:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=914 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:914:Notes"
msgid "A marvelous achievement, these gauntlets were forged and woven by the Dwarves of Stone City.  The offer both flexibility and strong protection.  The only trouble is that the wearer's skin is sometimes caught in the mesh, leading to painful pinches."
msgstr "놀라운 솜씨를 자랑하는 이 장갑은 스톤 시티의 드워프들이 단조하고 엮어 만들었습니다. 유연성과 강력한 보호력을 모두 갖추고 있지만, 착용자의 피부가 그물망에 걸려 따끔거리는 경우가 종종 발생합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=915 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:915:Name"
msgid "Dragon Hide Gauntlets"
msgstr "드래곤 가죽 건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=915 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:915:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=915 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:915:Notes"
msgid "Dragon hide -- as can be expected -- makes for an outstanding material for gauntlets, offering hand protection surpassing many simpler iron or steel designs. The only downside is that the leather is thick and rigid, somewhat limiting the dexterity of movements."
msgstr "예상대로 드래곤가죽은 장갑 소재로 탁월하며, 단순한 철이나 강철 장갑보다 훨씬 뛰어난 손 보호 기능을 제공합니다. 다만 가죽이 두껍고 뻣뻣해서 움직임이 다소 제한된다는 점이 단점입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=916 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:916:Name"
msgid "Mogred Gauntlets"
msgstr "모그레드 건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=916 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:916:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=916 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:916:Notes"
msgid "Made from the hide of the Mogred beast on Karigor, these gauntlets are tough, supple, and magic resistant.  The two red spots used to have poisonous spines growing from them."
msgstr "카리고르에 사는 모그레드 짐승의 가죽으로 만들어진 이 건틀릿은 질기고 유연하며 마법에 대한 저항력이 있습니다. 두 개의 붉은 반점에는 원래 독이 든 가시가 자라나 있었습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=917 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:917:Name"
msgid "Leather Boots"
msgstr "가죽 장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=917 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:917:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=917 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:917:Notes"
msgid "These boots are made of soft leather for a more comfortable fit, but they offer little protection in combat."
msgstr "이 부츠는 편안한 착용감을 위해 부드러운 가죽으로 만들어졌지만, 전투 시 보호 기능은 거의 제공하지 않습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=918 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:918:Name"
msgid "Steel Plated Boots"
msgstr "강철판 장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=918 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:918:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=918 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:918:Notes"
msgid "This pair of leather boots has been fitted with steel plates on the top of the foot and at the shin."
msgstr "이 가죽 부츠는 발등과 정강이 부분에 강철판이 장착되어 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=919 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:919:Name"
msgid "Ranger Boots"
msgstr "레인저 장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=919 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:919:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=919 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:919:Notes"
msgid "A quality set of Erathian leather boots.  This pair has the usual features of Erathian leather craftsmanship:  Soft, water resistant, and quiet.  "
msgstr "에라시아 가죽으로 만든 고급 부츠입니다. 이 부츠는 에라시아 가죽 제품의 전형적인 특징인 부드러움, 방수성, 그리고 소음 방지 기능을 갖추고 있습니다.  "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=91 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:91:Name"
msgid "Minotaur Chainmail"
msgstr "미노타우로스 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=91 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:91:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chainmail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=91 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:91:Notes"
msgid "Of a design originally created by the Minotaurs for their Vori campaigns, this type of chainmail, with its good coverage and fine construction, has proven popular among other races. Now the armorsmiths of Bathazar Lair construct it in sizes for any with ready gold to spend."
msgstr "원래 미노타우로스가 보리 원정을 위해 제작했던 이 사슬 갑옷은 뛰어난 보호력과 정교한 구조로 다른 종족들 사이에서도 인기를 얻었습니다. 이제 발타자르 은신처의 갑옷 장인들은 돈만 있다면 누구든 원하는 사이즈로 이 사슬 갑옷을 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=920 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:920:Name"
msgid "Knight's Boots"
msgstr "기사의 장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=920 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:920:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=920 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:920:Notes"
msgid "Polished silver boots with velvet interiors, these boots are lighter than steel boots and far more comfortable.  They look pretty snappy, too."
msgstr "광택이 나는 은색 부츠에 벨벳 안감이 더해진 이 부츠는 안전화보다 가볍고 훨씬 편안합니다. 게다가 꽤 멋스러워 보이기도 합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=921 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:921:Name"
msgid "Paladin Boots"
msgstr "성기사 장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=921 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:921:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=921 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:921:Notes"
msgid "Made in the forge of Byron Rockermann, these silver and steel boots are amongst the best in the world.  The are enormously strong, yet fit comfortable and flexibly in all the right spots."
msgstr "바이런 로커만의 대장간에서 제작된 이 은과 강철로 만든 부츠는 세계 최고 수준입니다. 놀라울 정도로 튼튼하면서도 필요한 모든 부분에서 편안하고 유연하게 착용할 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=922 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:922:Name"
msgid "Brass Ring"
msgstr "황동 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=922 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:922:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=922 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:922:Notes"
msgid "A tarnished brass ring.  Polished up, you might be able to sell it for something…but don't expect much."
msgstr "색이 바랜 황동 반지. 잘 닦으면 얼마에 팔 수 있을지도 모르지만… 큰 기대는 하지 마세요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=923 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:923:Name"
msgid "Pearl Ring"
msgstr "진주 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=923 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:923:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=923 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:923:Notes"
msgid "A large, imperfect pearl adorns this otherwise unremarkable gold ring."
msgstr "크고 모양이 약간 불완전한 진주 하나가 이 평범해 보이는 금반지를 장식하고 있다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=924 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:924:Name"
msgid "Platinum Ring"
msgstr "백금 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=924 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:924:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=924 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:924:Notes"
msgid "At first glance silver, this ring is actually made of platinum.  The gemstone is a small, flawed diamond."
msgstr "언뜻 보기엔 은색처럼 보이지만, 이 반지는 사실 백금으로 만들어졌습니다. 보석은 작고 흠이 있는 다이아몬드입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=925 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:925:Name"
msgid "Emerald Ring"
msgstr "에메랄드 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=925 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:925:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=925 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:925:Notes"
msgid "A large, cut emerald adorns an otherwise plain silver ring."
msgstr "크고 정교하게 세공된 에메랄드가 심플한 은반지를 장식하고 있다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=926 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:926:Name"
msgid "Sapphire Ring"
msgstr "사파이어 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=926 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:926:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=926 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:926:Notes"
msgid "Three small sapphires are mounted at the top of this silver and gold ring.  Rings of this quality are often enchanted."
msgstr "이 은과 금으로 된 반지 윗부분에는 작은 사파이어 세 개가 박혀 있습니다. 이처럼 고급스러운 반지에는 종종 마법이 깃들어 있다고 전해집니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=927 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:927:Name"
msgid "Warlock's Ring"
msgstr "흑마법사의 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=927 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:927:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=927 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:927:Notes"
msgid "This complex and gaudy arrangement of amethysts on platinum can be appealing, if you like that sort of thing."
msgstr "백금 위에 복잡하고 화려하게 배열된 자수정은 그런 스타일을 좋아한다면 매력적으로 보일 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=928 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:928:Name"
msgid "Enchanted Ring"
msgstr "마법의 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=928 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:928:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=928 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:928:Notes"
msgid "A rare gem-within-gem of emerald and garnet is set upon a fine gold ring."
msgstr "에메랄드와 석류석이 겹겹이 세팅된 희귀한 보석이 고급스러운 금반지에 장식되어 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=929 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:929:Name"
msgid "Dazzling Ring"
msgstr "눈부신 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=929 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:929:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=929 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:929:Notes"
msgid "A beautiful rosetta of rubies and emeralds on gold backing.  The ring itself is platinum."
msgstr "금 바탕에 루비와 에메랄드가 아름답게 세팅된 로제타 모양의 반지입니다. 반지 자체는 플래티넘 소재입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=92 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:92:Name"
msgid "Siertal Chainmail"
msgstr "시에르탈 사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=92 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:92:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chainmail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=92 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:92:Notes"
msgid "The Alvarian Dark Elves guard their siertal-alloy formula carefully. Chainmail made from this metal is both light and capable of turning the hardest blades."
msgstr "알바르의 다크 엘프들은 시에르탈 합금 제조법을 철저히 비밀에 부치고 있다. 이 금속으로 만든 사슬 갑옷은 가벼우면서도 가장 단단한 칼날도 휘어지게 할 수 있다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=930 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:930:Name"
msgid "Wizard Ring"
msgstr "마법사의 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=930 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:930:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=930 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:930:Notes"
msgid "Three perfect garnets set into silver belie the enchantments used to create this ring.  Handling the ring for long makes your hand tingle."
msgstr "은에 세팅된 세 개의 완벽한 석류석은 이 반지를 만드는 데 사용된 마법을 짐작하게 합니다. 반지를 오랫동안 만지면 손에 짜릿한 느낌이 듭니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=931 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:931:Name"
msgid "Angel's Ring"
msgstr "천사의 반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=931 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:931:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=931 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:931:Notes"
msgid "A very strange brown stone (petrified wood?) is mounted on a metal that looks like gold, but is much lighter."
msgstr "아주 특이한 갈색 돌(화석화된 나무?)이 금처럼 보이지만 훨씬 밝은 금속 위에 박혀 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=932 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:932:Name"
msgid "Eyeball Amulet"
msgstr "눈알 부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=932 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:932:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=932 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:932:Notes"
msgid "This strange amulet has a glass eye on the end of a cheap brass chain.  A novelty, but probably not worth much."
msgstr "이 이상한 부적은 값싼 황동 사슬 끝에 유리 눈이 달려 있습니다. 신기한 물건이긴 하지만, 아마도 가치는 별로 없을 겁니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=933 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:933:Name"
msgid "Bronze Amulet"
msgstr "청동 부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=933 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:933:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=933 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:933:Notes"
msgid "A baroque bronze amulet with an ill define image stamped on the face.  Cheap, and tasteless."
msgstr "표면에 불분명한 이미지가 새겨진 바로크풍 청동 부적입니다. 싸구려에 촌스럽네요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=934 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:934:Name"
msgid "Witch's Amulet"
msgstr "마녀의 부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=934 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:934:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=934 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:934:Notes"
msgid "A plaster cast of a baby's hand was used to form this strange silver amulet.  There is some unidentifiable symbol stamped in the center of the amulet."
msgstr "아기의 손 석고 모형을 사용하여 이 기묘한 은제 부적을 만들었습니다. 부적 중앙에는 정체를 알 수 없는 문양이 새겨져 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=935 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:935:Name"
msgid "Death's Head Pendant"
msgstr "해골 펜던트"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=935 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:935:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=935 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:935:Notes"
msgid "Straight out of Deyja, this is just the sort of thing you would expect from Necromancers.  The silver skull in the center is modeled from a real, shrunken skull, and the tiny rubies in the eyes glow in the dark."
msgstr "데이자에서 바로 튀어나온 듯한 이 물건은 네크로맨서에게서 기대할 수 있는 바로 그런 종류입니다. 중앙의 은빛 해골은 실제 해골을 축소한 것을 본떠 만들었고, 눈에 박힌 작은 루비는 어둠 속에서 빛납니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=936 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:936:Name"
msgid "Sun Amulet"
msgstr "태양 부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=936 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:936:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=936 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:936:Notes"
msgid "A glorious gold amulet with the ancient symbol of the sun in the center.  The amulet is from Karigor, and the craftsmanship is flawless."
msgstr "중앙에 고대 태양 상징이 새겨진 찬란한 금제 부적입니다. 카리고르에서 제작된 이 부적은 흠잡을 데 없는 장인 정신이 돋보입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=937 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:937:Name"
msgid "Wand of Fire"
msgstr "화염 마법봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=937 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:937:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=937 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:937:Notes"
msgid "The magical process that was used to enchant this wand turned it sky blue.  It's made of wood and glass.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr "이 지팡이를 마법으로 강화하는 과정에서 하늘색으로 변했습니다. 나무와 유리로 만들어졌으며, 사용하려면 무기를 장착하듯이 착용해야 합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=938 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:938:Name"
msgid "Wand of Sparks"
msgstr "전기 불꽃 마법봉"

