#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=988 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:988:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gemstone"
msgstr "보석"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=988 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:988:Notes"
msgid "An Antagarichan mountain crystal. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "안타개릭산에서 채취한 수정입니다. 보석으로서의 품질은 좋지만 마법적인 효능은 없으니 팔아도 괜찮을 것 같습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=989 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:989:Name"
msgid "Topaz"
msgstr "황옥"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=989 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:989:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gemstone"
msgstr "보석"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=989 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:989:Notes"
msgid "An Antagarichan small topaz. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "안타개릭산 소형 토파즈입니다. 보석으로서의 품질은 좋지만 마법적인 효능은 없으니 팔아버리는 게 나을지도 모르겠습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=98 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:98:Name"
msgid "Dragoning Plate"
msgstr "드래곤 판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=98 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:98:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=98 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:98:Notes"
msgid "The technique for making plate armor of erudine sheets is not known on Jadame. In fact, it is only produced by the master armorer, Derrick Goreth of Erathia who spent a lifetime constructing his famed White Light Forgeworks."
msgstr "제이덤에서는 에루딘 판금 갑옷 제작 기술이 알려져 있지 않습니다. 사실, 이 갑옷은 평생을 바쳐 유명한 화이트 라이트 제련소를 건설한 에라시아 출신의 명장 갑옷 제작자 데릭 고레스만이 만들 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=990 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:990:Name"
msgid "Emerald"
msgstr "에메랄드"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=990 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:990:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gemstone"
msgstr "보석"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=990 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:990:Notes"
msgid "An Antagarichan large emerald. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "안타개릭산 대형 에메랄드입니다. 보석으로서의 품질은 좋지만 마법적인 효능은 없으니 파시는 게 나을지도 모르겠습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=991 field=Name status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:991:Name"
msgid "Sapphire"
msgstr "사파이어"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=991 field=NotIdentifiedName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:991:NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gemstone"
msgstr "보석"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=991 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:991:Notes"
msgid "An Antagarichan sapphire in a flat round brilliant cut.  As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "플랫 라운드 브릴리언트 컷의 안타개릭산 사파이어입니다. 보석으로서의 품질은 좋지만 마법적인 효능은 없으니, 파시는 게 나을지도 모르겠습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=992 field=Name status=translated
