#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt record=997 field=Notes status=translated
msgctxt "engine:items.txt:997:Notes"
msgid "An Antagarichan diamond, flawless and set in an intricate gold frame. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
