#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=323 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:323:Greeting1"
msgid "Hey! Hey, you! Halt, I must speak with you for a spell. It’s a matter of an utmost importance. Though even ‘utmost’ can’t convey just how important the matter is. \n*The woman glances you over with a firm frown forming on her brow* \nHow are you doing, by the way? Any sudden pains? Feeling strangely empty inside? Nothing? Well, that’s a relief, I have to say. Though I was pretty sure I had the hang of it by now. Third time’s the charm, aye?"
msgstr "이봐요! 이봐, 당신! 멈추시오. 잠시 할 말이 있소. 대단히 중요한 일이오. 하지만 '대단히'라는 말조차 얼마나 중요한 일인지 전하지 못하겠군요. \n*여자가 눈썹을 단단히 찌푸린 채 당신들을 훑어본다* \n그런데 상태는 어떻습니까? 갑자기 아픈 곳은 없고? 속이 이상하게 텅 빈 느낌은? 아무것도 없습니까? 솔직히 다행이군요. 이제는 요령을 익혔다고 꽤 확신했거든요. 세 번째에는 성공한다는 말도 있잖소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=323 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:323:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey! Halt, I must speak with you for a spell. It’s a matter of an utmost importance."
msgstr "이봐요! 멈추시오. 잠시 할 말이 있소. 대단히 중요한 일이오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=324 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:324:Greeting1"
msgid "Oh my, I'm so relieved to see you here! Something possibly terrible is afoot! Yes, I know, you've saved the world three times, but that means there's nobody else who can match you in skill and cunning, and boy, do we need skill and cunning! Possibly. Almost for certain, really."
msgstr "아, 여기서 만나니 정말 안심이군요! 어쩌면 끔찍한 일이 벌어지고 있습니다! 네, 세상을 세 번 구했다는 건 압니다. 하지만 그건 당신들의 실력과 재치에 맞설 사람이 없다는 뜻이고, 세상에, 지금 우리에게 필요한 게 바로 실력과 재치예요! 아마도요. 사실 거의 확실합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=324 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:324:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=325 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:325:Greeting1"
msgid "Pew pew pew! It looked easier than dealing with pesky goblins. But am I glad the Devil Queen is down! *Verdant shivers*. Disgusting thing. How did it smell? I don’t get full sensory experiences when using the spectator spells. \nIt’s nice we get to see the slow rebuilding of the village of Sweet Water now. To have a place with such a name evoke fear in the people that hear it, it doesn’t sit well with me. \nAnd since we’re talking about things that don’t sit well with me, same can be said about you being knighted by a little boy you’ve had to fetch from the circus. I will never understand politics. Ever. In my eyes – you’re the world’s true royalty, and my chronicle will be sure to reflect that! Objectively, of course.\nOh, and this little thing is for you as well. So you don’t think I’m being lazy over here letting you do all the work."
msgstr "퓽퓽퓽! 성가신 고블린들을 상대하는 것보다 쉬워 보였소. 그래도 데빌 여왕이 쓰러져 정말 다행이군요! *버던트가 몸을 떤다*. 역겨운 것이었소. 냄새는 어땠습니까? 관전 주문을 쓰면 모든 감각을 온전히 느낄 수는 없거든요. \n이제 스위트 워터 마을이 천천히 재건되는 모습을 볼 수 있어 좋군요. 그렇게 달콤한 이름을 가진 장소가 듣는 사람들에게 공포를 불러일으킨다는 건 마음에 들지 않았습니다. \n마음에 들지 않는 이야기가 나온 김에, 서커스에서 데려와야 했던 어린 소년에게 기사 작위를 받은 것도 마찬가지예요. 정치는 영원히 이해하지 못할 겁니다. 내 눈에는 당신들이야말로 세상의 진정한 왕족이며, 내 연대기에도 반드시 그렇게 기록할 거예요! 물론 객관적으로요.\n아, 그리고 이 작은 것도 당신들에게 드리죠. 내가 여기서 빈둥거리며 모든 일을 당신들에게 떠넘겼다고 생각하지 않도록 말입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=325 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:325:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=326 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:326:Greeting1"
msgid "You’ve done it! I am… amazed. *Verdant is visibly trying to keep her composure, though it’s fair to assume she’d try at least poke your face to get a touch of heroism.* It can’t have been easy, I shudder at the mere thought of diving deep underwater with suits of this era… That sounds absolutely insane.\nReally? Not that terrifying? Guess that’s why you’re the heroes and I’m the hero-remover. Hehe.\nThe consortium doesn’t know yet about the things that have transpired here. Thank goodness they’re usually pretty confused about what’s going on and where. But with your abilities, soon there will be nothing to know about. Or at least nothing to know about in fury. Thank you, on my behalf, and on the behalf of the people of Antagrich. \nWhat did Katherine do in the meanwhile, huh? Aside of bossing you around and stirring trouble with that Elven King. You should be the one patting her on shoulder and telling her good job on the paperwork.\nHere, I’ve made something for you. I hope you find it useful."
msgstr "해냈군요! 나는…놀랐습니다. *버던트는 애써 침착함을 유지하려 하지만, 영웅심을 조금이라도 만져 보겠다며 적어도 당신들의 얼굴을 찔러 보려 할 것 같다.* 쉽지 않았을 텐데요. 이 시대의 장비를 입고 깊은 물속으로 잠수한다는 생각만 해도 몸이 떨려요…정말 미친 짓처럼 들립니다.\n정말요? 그렇게 무섭지는 않았다고? 역시 당신들은 영웅이고 나는 영웅 제거자인 이유가 있군요. 헤헤.\n컨소시엄은 아직 이곳에서 일어난 일을 모릅니다. 다행히 그들은 보통 어디서 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 꽤 혼란스러워하거든요. 하지만 당신들의 능력이라면 곧 알아야 할 일 자체가 사라질 겁니다. 적어도 분노하며 알아야 할 일은 없겠지요. 나와 안타개릭 사람들을 대신해 감사드립니다. \n그동안 캐서린은 뭘 했답니까? 당신들에게 명령하고 그 엘프 왕과 문제를 일으킨 것 말고요. 오히려 당신들이 그녀의 어깨를 두드리며 서류 작업을 잘했다고 칭찬해야 할 겁니다.\n자, 당신들을 위해 뭔가 만들었습니다. 유용하게 쓰길 바랍니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=326 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:326:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=327 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:327:Greeting1"
msgid "Hey! Congratulations! That was a true show of power. Though I have to say, I felt a little sad watching Escaton die. There was something affable about the fella, something tragic to his story, don’t you think? \nBut I am glad to see our Elemental Lord friends back in their happy little dimensions. They’re kind of like your friendly neighborhood wild animals, breaks my heart to see them suffer. Don’t scowl at me, I absolutely love animals so it’s definitely a compliment!\nOnly shame the crystal is gone. I was meaning to chip some off it for jewelry purposes, but I didn’t get around to it in time. Oh well, maybe in the next iteration, right?\nI’ve made a little something for you. Infused with love and adoration!"
msgstr "이봐요! 축하합니다! 정말 압도적인 힘을 보여 주었군요. 하지만 에스카톤이 죽는 모습을 보니 조금 슬펐다는 건 말해야겠어요. 그 친구에게는 어딘가 호감 가는 면이 있었고, 사연에도 비극적인 점이 있었지 않습니까? \n그래도 원소 군주 친구들이 행복하고 작은 자기 차원으로 돌아간 모습을 보니 기쁩니다. 그들은 친근한 동네 야생동물 같은 존재라 고통받는 모습을 보면 마음이 아프거든요. 그렇게 노려보지 마시오. 나는 동물을 정말 좋아하니 분명 칭찬입니다!\n수정이 사라진 것만은 아쉽군요. 장신구를 만들려고 조금 떼어 두려 했는데 제때 하지 못했어요. 뭐, 다음 반복에서는 할 수 있겠지요?\n당신들을 위해 작은 것을 하나 만들었습니다. 사랑과 찬미를 듬뿍 담았소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=327 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:327:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=328 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:328:Greeting1"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=328 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:328:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=329 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:329:Greeting1"
msgid "Hey! Got my letter? I must speak with you. It’s a matter of an utmost importance. Though even ‘utmost’ can’t convey just how important the matter is. \n*The woman glances you over with a firm frown forming on her brow* \nHow are you doing, by the way? Any sudden pains? Feeling strangely empty inside? Nothing? Well, that’s a relief, I have to say. Though I was pretty sure I had the hang of it by now. Third time’s the charm, aye?"
msgstr "이봐요! 내 편지를 받았습니까? 할 말이 있소. 대단히 중요한 일이오. 하지만 '대단히'라는 말조차 얼마나 중요한 일인지 전하지 못하겠군요. \n*여자가 눈썹을 단단히 찌푸린 채 당신들을 훑어본다* \n그런데 상태는 어떻습니까? 갑자기 아픈 곳은 없고? 속이 이상하게 텅 빈 느낌은? 아무것도 없습니까? 솔직히 다행이군요. 이제는 요령을 익혔다고 꽤 확신했거든요. 세 번째에는 성공한다는 말도 있잖소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=329 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:329:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=32 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:32:Greeting1"
msgid "Hah! The only advantage that the Sun Temple had against us is no more. With the Nightshade Brazier back in our possession, we no longer need worry about the daytime defense of Shadowspire. We can march our undead to their very doors. We will destroy their temple and wipe them from the face of Jadame! Now that the tide of battle has turned in our favor, we of the Necromancers' Guild can more generously consider the request made by our friend, Bastian Loudrin. Thant can take over here while I am away sitting on your alliance council."
msgstr "하! 태양의 신전이 우리에게 갖고 있던 유일한 우위도 이제 사라졌군. 나이트셰이드 화로를 되찾았으니 더는 낮 동안 섀도스파이어를 방어할 걱정이 없소. 언데드 군대를 그들의 문 앞까지 진군시킬 수 있소. 그들의 신전을 파괴하고 제이덤에서 흔적조차 지워 버릴 것이오! 이제 전세가 우리에게 유리하게 돌아섰으니 강령술사 길드는 친구 바스티안 라우드린의 요청을 더 너그럽게 검토할 수 있소. 내가 동맹 의회에 참석하는 동안 탄트가 이곳을 맡을 것이오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=32 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:32:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=330 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:330:Greeting1"
msgid "Hey, you are here. Well, you need this letter to jump on path of previous heroes... You're a bunch of happy kids saved by a nice warlock fellow, spent your lives training, now all grown up and ready to roll. No need for a heavy roleplay, just don't be jerks. Go around, slap some goblins, squash a spider or two, poke a devil. Umm... I mean, an apprentice wizard, yes. No devils anywhere, forget the devils. I don't think I should be telling you things about your future. Well, their future. But also your future now. You know what I mean."
msgstr "이봐요, 왔군요. 전대 영웅들의 길로 뛰어들려면 이 편지가 필요합니다…당신들은 친절한 흑마법사에게 구원받고 평생 훈련하며 살아온 행복한 아이들이며, 이제 다 자라 출발할 준비를 마쳤소. 지나치게 심각한 역할극은 필요 없고, 그저 못된 짓만 하지 마시오. 돌아다니며 고블린을 몇 대 때리고, 거미 한두 마리를 뭉개고, 악마를 찔러 보시오. 음…그러니까 견습 마법사를 말한 겁니다, 그래요. 악마는 어디에도 없으니 악마 이야기는 잊으시오. 당신들의 미래를 말해 주면 안 될 것 같군요. 아니, 그들의 미래요. 하지만 이제는 당신들의 미래이기도 하군요. 무슨 말인지 알겠지요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=330 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:330:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=331 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:331:Greeting1"
msgid "*Verdant appears behind you suddenly.* Boo! Well, well, you've traveled through time! Look around, can you believe this town, these people, they're all centuries older than you? Or have yet to be born and built? How does it feel to think about it for the first time? Hah. Here, I've got something for you - it's a Connector Gem."
msgstr "*버던트가 갑자기 당신들 뒤에 나타난다.* 짠! 이것 보시오, 시간 여행을 했군요! 주변을 둘러보시오. 이 마을과 사람들은 모두 당신들보다 수백 년이나 오래되었다는 게 믿어집니까? 아니면 아직 태어나지도, 지어지지도 않았을 수도 있고요. 처음으로 그 사실을 생각하니 기분이 어떻습니까? 하. 자, 당신들에게 줄 것이 있습니다. 연결 보석입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=331 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:331:Greeting2"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=332 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:332:Greeting1"
msgid "(The boy runs up to you)\nHey! My lords! Great competition going to happen very soon!\n(Putting paper in your hands, he runs away)"
msgstr "(소년이 당신에게 달려온다)\n저기요! 나리들! 곧 큰 대회가 열린대요!\n(당신의 손에 종이를 쥐여 주고는 달아난다)"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=33 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:33:Greeting1"
msgid "Who are you? I don't recognize you, but I'm sure that whatever your business, it will add to my troubles."
msgstr "누구요? 낯선 얼굴이군. 하지만 무슨 용건이든 내 골칫거리를 더 늘릴 게 분명하오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=33 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:33:Greeting2"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=34 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:34:Greeting1"
msgid "So, Sandro has asked you to strike a blow against the Sun Temple! Though I hate the guild. I would be willing to help you. Half a serving of revenge is better than none."
msgstr "그렇군, 산드로가 태양의 신전을 공격해 달라고 했소! 나는 길드가 증오스럽지만, 당신들을 돕겠소. 복수는 절반만 해도 아예 못 하는 것보다는 나으니까."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=34 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:34:Greeting2"
msgid "So, do we move against the Sun Temple? Shall we get for Sandro his Nightshade Brazier?"
msgstr "그럼 태양의 신전을 공격하는 겁니까? 산드로에게 나이트셰이드 화로를 가져다줄까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=35 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:35:Greeting1"
msgid "Ah, you are sent by his high holiness…Oskar Tyre thinks to activate his agent. Though I would wish him no good, I will do as he asks. Yes, I have knowledge of the guild's Skeleton Transformer and believe I can destroy it. Very well, let us do this thing against the Necromancers' Guild. I will at least be able to strike against one of my enemies!"
msgstr "아, 지고하신 성하께서 보낸 이들이군…오스카 타이어가 자신의 요원을 움직이려는 모양이오. 그가 잘되기를 바라지는 않지만, 요구에는 따르겠소. 그래, 나는 길드의 해골 변환기에 대해 알고 있고 그것을 파괴할 수 있다고 생각하오. 좋소, 강령술사 길드에 맞서 이 일을 합시다. 적어도 내 원수 중 하나는 공격할 수 있겠군!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=35 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:35:Greeting2"
msgid "Are you now ready to destroy the guild's Skeleton Transformer? I will join you and we can be about the task!"
msgstr "이제 길드의 해골 변환기를 파괴할 준비가 되었습니까? 나도 합류해서 함께 해치우겠소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=36 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:36:Greeting1"
msgid "Hah! So both Sandro and Oskar Tyre seek to use me against the other. I have thought of the possibility of this occurring. I believe that if I were to strike against one, it would become impossible for me to strike the other.So I guess we have a choice--help the guild or the temple. Which? I don't know, as my hatred for both is equal. I suppose I'll have to do with a half measure of revenge."
msgstr "하! 산드로와 오스카 타이어가 모두 나를 이용해 상대를 공격하려 하는군. 이런 일이 생길 가능성은 생각해 두었소. 한쪽을 공격하면 다른 쪽은 공격할 수 없게 될 것 같소.그러니 길드를 도울지 신전을 도울지 선택해야겠군. 어느 쪽이냐고? 모르겠소. 둘 다 똑같이 증오하니까. 결국 절반짜리 복수에 만족해야 할 것 같군."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=36 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:36:Greeting2"
msgid "So, have you decided to steal the Nightshade Brazier from the Temple, or to destroy the guild's Skeleton Transformer? Either way…I will join you. But let us do it. I would slack my thirst for revenge."
msgstr "태양의 신전에서 나이트셰이드 화로를 훔칠지, 길드의 해골 변환기를 파괴할지 결정했습니까? 어느 쪽이든…나도 합류하겠소. 하지만 어서 행동합시다. 복수의 갈증을 풀고 싶소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=37 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:37:Greeting1"
msgid "So you are sent by Bastian Loudrin? Well, then. What would he have us hear?"
msgstr "바스티안 라우드린이 보냈다고? 그렇군. 그가 우리에게 무엇을 전하려 하는 것이오?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=37 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:37:Greeting2"
msgid "The Light upon you. What need you of our temple?"
msgstr "빛이 그대와 함께하기를. 우리 신전에 무슨 용무가 있습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=38 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:38:Greeting1"
msgid "Hail, heroes of Jadame! I'm glad you’ve returned. I want to make it clear that the merchant guild has made this guildhouse permanently open to you. Now that the crisis is over, the other council members have returned home. Though they are gone, good will prevails between us. The beginning of a new era of peace? We will see. Certainly it is a time of prosperity! Our caravans are already back in operation."
msgstr "제이덤의 영웅들이여, 만세! 돌아와 주어 기쁘오. 상인 길드는 이 길드회관을 영원히 당신들에게 개방하기로 했다는 것을 분명히 말해 두겠소. 위기가 끝나 다른 의원들은 고향으로 돌아갔소. 그들은 떠났지만 우리 사이의 우호는 계속될 것이오. 새로운 평화의 시대가 시작되는 걸까? 두고 봐야겠지. 분명한 것은 번영의 시대라는 점이오! 우리 대상단도 벌써 다시 움직이고 있소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=38 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:38:Greeting2"
msgid "Hail, Heroes of Jadame!"
msgstr "제이덤의 영웅들이여, 만세!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=39 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:39:Greeting1"
msgid "Ah well, very good to see you. Quite a lot of trouble is behind us, no? What brings the \"Heroes of Jadame\" to my camp?"
msgstr "아, 다시 만나니 정말 반갑소. 큰 문제들은 대부분 지나간 것 같군, 그렇지 않소? '제이덤의 영웅들'께서 내 야영지에는 무슨 일로 오셨소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=39 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:39:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=3 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:3:Greeting1"
msgid "Welcome to Dagger Wound Island, Journeyman of Alvar.\nI am Brekish Onefang, Clan Leader.\nI wish I was greeting you during better times.The mountain of fire has caused serious damage to my village and its people.\nMany buildings have been damaged, and the bridges that connect the smaller islands to the main island have been destroyed!\nMany people are missing or stranded on these smaller islands!\nWe must help them!"
msgstr "대거 운드 섬에 온 것을 환영하오, 알바르의 숙련자여.\n나는 부족장 브레키시 원팽이오.\n더 나은 때에 그대를 맞이했으면 좋았을 텐데. 불의 산이 우리 마을과 주민들에게 심각한 피해를 입혔소.\n많은 건물이 파손되었고, 작은 섬들과 본섬을 잇던 다리들도 무너졌소!\n많은 이들이 실종되거나 작은 섬들에 고립되어 있소!\n우리가 그들을 도와야 하오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=3 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:3:Greeting2"
msgid "Have the Portals been fixed?\nMy stranded people are able to return to the safety of the village here on the main island?"
msgstr "차원문은 수리되었습니까?\n고립된 우리 사람들이 이 본섬 마을의 안전한 곳으로 돌아올 수 있습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=40 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:40:Greeting1"
msgid "Together we have done a great deed. I look forward to telling my heir the tale. How can I help you, heroes?"
msgstr "우리는 함께 위대한 일을 해냈소. 언젠가 후계자에게 이 이야기를 들려줄 날이 기대되는군. 영웅들이여, 무엇을 도와드리겠소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=40 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:40:Greeting2"
msgid "Welcome. My cave is open to you."
msgstr "어서 오시오. 내 동굴은 당신들에게 열려 있소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=41 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:41:Greeting1"
msgid "The Light has shined upon us indeed. Our temple is always open to the \"Heroes of Jadame.\" How may I help you?"
msgstr "빛이 참으로 우리를 비추었군요. 우리 신전은 언제나 '제이덤의 영웅들'에게 열려 있습니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=41 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:41:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes, friends?"
msgstr "무슨 일이오, 친구들?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=42 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:42:Greeting1"
msgid "How good of you to grace us with your presence. Heroes of Jadame. Saviors of Balthazar Lair. Both fitting titles for you who have done so much for me herd and for all of Jadame!"
msgstr "몸소 찾아 주시다니 영광이오. 제이덤의 영웅들, 발타자르 소굴의 구원자들. 우리 무리와 제이덤 전체를 위해 그토록 많은 일을 한 당신들에게 두 칭호 모두 잘 어울리오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=42 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:42:Greeting2"
msgid "Hail, Saviors of Balthazar Lair!"
msgstr "발타자르 소굴의 구원자들이여, 만세!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=43 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:43:Greeting1"
msgid "Hail! In the name of the guild, I welcome you. Know that we consider you our friends, Heroes of Jadame. What would you have of us today?"
msgstr "만세! 길드를 대표해 환영하오. 제이덤의 영웅들이여, 우리는 당신들을 친구로 여기고 있소. 오늘은 우리에게 무엇을 바라시오?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=43 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:43:Greeting2"
msgid "Greetings, heroes."
msgstr "안녕하시오, 영웅들이여."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=44 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:44:Greeting1"
msgid "If you're looking for my master, Xanthor, he is not here. Can I help you?"
msgstr "내 주인 잔토르를 찾는 거라면 그는 이곳에 없소. 내가 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=44 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:44:Greeting2"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=45 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:45:Greeting1"
msgid "Hmph. So you are the heroes of the alliance. Not much to look at, I must say. Still, I suppose you have survived much to see this day. I only hope you are up to the task I think fate has for you. If not, we are all surely doomed!"
msgstr "흥. 그대들이 동맹의 영웅들이군. 겉보기엔 별것 없어 보이는군. 그래도 오늘까지 살아남았으니 많은 일을 겪었겠지. 운명이 그대들에게 맡길 일을 감당할 수 있기만 바라겠소. 그렇지 못하면 우리 모두 틀림없이 파멸할 테니까!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=45 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:45:Greeting2"
msgid "You are back? Have you need of advice? Or are you finding the task at hand too difficult?"
msgstr "돌아왔군요? 조언이 필요합니까? 아니면 맡은 일이 너무 어렵습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=46 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:46:Greeting1"
msgid "There. It is built. Take this Conflux Key. As I have explained, it will allow you to use the crystal in the town square as a gateway--much as you've used the elemental gateways to reach the elemental planes. The crystal gateway will take you to the place between the planes.On this \"Plane Between Planes\" you must find the source of the cataclysm. What it is, I don't know, but whatever it is, it is there. Go now! The fate of the land, I'm afraid, lies on your shoulders. Be worthy of the task!"
msgstr "됐소. 완성했소. 이 컨플럭스 열쇠를 받으시오. 설명했듯이, 이것을 사용하면 마을 광장의 수정을 관문으로 쓸 수 있소. 원소 차원으로 향할 때 사용했던 원소 관문과 비슷하오. 수정 관문은 그대들을 차원 사이의 장소로 데려갈 것이오.이 '차원 사이의 차원'에서 대재앙의 근원을 찾아야 하오. 그것이 무엇인지는 모르지만, 무엇이든 그곳에 있소. 어서 가시오! 유감스럽게도 이 땅의 운명이 그대들의 어깨에 달렸소. 그 임무에 걸맞은 모습을 보이시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=46 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:46:Greeting2"
msgid "You must go through the crystal gateway! It leads to the plane between planes. The cause of the cataclysm lies through it--seek out the source!"
msgstr "수정 관문을 통과해야 합니다! 그곳은 차원 사이의 차원으로 이어집니다. 대재앙의 원인은 그 너머에 있으니, 근원을 찾아내십시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=47 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:47:Greeting1"
msgid "You have conducted yourselves greatly. I must say I had my doubts about your abilities, but no longer. You are truly worthy of the praise that all lavish upon you."
msgstr "그대들은 훌륭히 행동했소. 솔직히 능력을 의심했지만 이제는 아니오. 사람들이 쏟아붓는 찬사를 받을 자격이 충분하오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=47 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:47:Greeting2"
msgid "How can I help you, friends?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요, 친구들?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=48 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:48:Greeting1"
msgid "I sense some small presence in this chamber. Greater than gnats, but so much less than myself. Where is it….Ah, there it is. What have we here? Some of the beings of Jadame? Yes. Destroy them? Surely within my rights…but, no. It has been a slow millennia. Perhaps they will provide some diversion.Speak then, lower ones! What would you have of Escaton the Destroyer of Worlds?"
msgstr "이 방에서 아주 작은 존재가 느껴지는군. 각다귀보다는 크지만 나에 비하면 한없이 하찮아. 어디 있지….아, 저기 있군. 이게 뭐지? 제이덤의 존재들인가? 그래. 파괴해 버릴까? 당연히 내 권리 안의 일이지만…아니, 그러지 않겠다. 지난 수천 년은 지루했으니, 저들이 약간의 유희를 제공할지도 모르지.말해 보아라, 하등한 것들아! 세계의 파괴자 에스카톤에게 무엇을 바라느냐?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=48 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:48:Greeting2"
msgid "Ah the gnatlings are returned. I must consider why I allow them their continued existence. But this I will do some other time.Speak then, while you still may, puny ones."
msgstr "아, 날벌레들이 돌아왔군. 왜 아직도 살려 두고 있는지 생각해 봐야겠어. 하지만 그건 다음에 하지. 자, 아직 목숨이 붙어 있을 때 말해라, 하찮은 것들아."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=49 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:49:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings.\nYou seek instruction?"
msgstr "안녕하시오.\n가르침을 구하러 왔소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=49 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:49:Greeting2"
msgid "Good day.\nYou seek to gain knowledge?"
msgstr "좋은 하루입니다.\n지식을 얻으러 오셨습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=4 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:4:Greeting1"
msgid "You must tell the Merchants of Alvar of the Regnan raid on Dagger Wound Island!\nThey must send help!"
msgstr "대거 운드 섬이 레그나의 습격을 받았다고 알바르 상인들에게 알려야 합니다!\n그들이 지원을 보내야 합니다!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=4 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:4:Greeting2"
msgid "We are in debt to you!\nNot only did you save my stranded people, but you also returned to stop the Regnan assault upon my island!"
msgstr "우리는 당신에게 큰 빚을 졌습니다!\n고립된 우리 사람들을 구해 주었을 뿐 아니라, 돌아와 레그나의 섬 침공까지 막아 주셨군요!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=50 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:50:Greeting1"
msgid "Who is there? Am I finally to be released?"
msgstr "누구냐? 드디어 나를 풀어 주러 온 것이냐?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=50 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:50:Greeting2"
msgid "Are you here to free me?"
msgstr "나를 풀어 주러 왔습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=51 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:51:Greeting1"
msgid "Help me! I have been able to live thus far, but for how much longer can I?"
msgstr "도와주십시오! 지금까지는 살아남았지만, 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을지 모르겠습니다!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=51 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:51:Greeting2"
msgid "Will you now release me from my torment?"
msgstr "이제 나를 이 고통에서 해방해 주겠습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=52 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:52:Greeting1"
msgid "Ah, mortals…good. You are not of my tormentors. Release me from this place! I will not harm you."
msgstr "아, 필멸자들이군…좋다. 너희는 나를 괴롭힌 자들이 아니구나. 이곳에서 나를 풀어 다오! 너희를 해치지 않겠다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=52 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:52:Greeting2"
msgid "Release me from this cell, mortals!"
msgstr "필멸자들이여, 이 감옥에서 나를 풀어 다오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=53 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:53:Greeting1"
msgid "Free me quickly! I have survived so far, but it is only a matter of time before I am extinguished!"
msgstr "어서 나를 풀어 다오! 지금까지는 버텼지만, 내가 소멸하는 것은 시간문제다!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=53 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:53:Greeting2"
msgid "My fires dampen. Release me!"
msgstr "내 불길이 사그라진다. 나를 풀어 다오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=54 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:54:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings. I am Sahil Ittalle, the historian of the Alvarian Merchant Guild. How can I help you today?"
msgstr "안녕하시오. 나는 알바르 상인 길드의 역사가 사힐 이탈레요. 오늘은 무엇을 도와드리겠소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=54 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:54:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes? Can I help you?"
msgstr "네? 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=55 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:55:Greeting1"
msgid "Ah, you must be the alliance council's heroes. Well met. Catherine and I are here to help. What can I do for you?"
msgstr "아, 동맹 의회에서 보낸 영웅들이겠군. 반갑소. 캐서린과 나는 당신들을 돕기 위해 왔소. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=55 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:55:Greeting2"
msgid "Greetings!"
msgstr "안녕하시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=56 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:56:Greeting1"
msgid "It was a harrowing journey to reach your shores, I assure you! But the events of the cataclysm force all to extreme duties. I'm sure you understand. But down to issues. How can I help you?"
msgstr "당신들의 해안에 도착하기까지 참으로 험난한 여정이었소! 하지만 대재앙은 모두에게 극단적인 의무를 강요하지. 이해하리라 믿소. 그럼 본론으로 들어갑시다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=56 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:56:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=57 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:57:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings! I am Asael Fromago, the world's preeminent connoisseur of fine cheeses. Oh, some might say that Elkanah Juusto of Edenbrook holds the title, but he is a dilettante--a mere dabbler!"
msgstr "안녕하시오! 나는 세계 최고의 고급 치즈 감정가 아사엘 프로마고요. 에덴브룩의 엘카나 주스토가 그 칭호를 지녔다고 말하는 이들도 있지만, 그는 아마추어요. 그저 겉핥기만 하는 자지!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=57 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:57:Greeting2"
msgid "Greetings! How may Asael Fromago, master of cheeses, serve you?"
msgstr "안녕하시오! 치즈의 대가 아사엘 프로마고가 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=58 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:58:Greeting1"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "모험가여, 반갑소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=58 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:58:Greeting2"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "모험가여, 반갑소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=59 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:59:Greeting1"
msgid "Yeah? What do you want?"
msgstr "그래? 무슨 일이야?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=59 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:59:Greeting2"
msgid "Yeah? What do you want?"
msgstr "그래? 무슨 일이야?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=5 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:5:Greeting1"
msgid "What?\nI don't have time to talk now!\nI need to pack some things and leave!"
msgstr "뭐요?\n지금은 이야기할 시간이 없소!\n짐을 챙겨 떠나야 하오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=5 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:5:Greeting2"
msgid "Be quick with your business. I must prepare to escape these islands!"
msgstr "용건을 서두르시오. 이 섬들을 탈출할 준비를 해야 하오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=60 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:60:Greeting1"
msgid "How are you today?"
msgstr "오늘은 어떻게 지내십니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=60 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:60:Greeting2"
msgid "How are you today?"
msgstr "오늘은 어떻게 지내십니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=61 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:61:Greeting1"
msgid "Yes? What is it?"
msgstr "네? 무슨 일이죠?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=61 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:61:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes? What is it?"
msgstr "네? 무슨 일이죠?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=62 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:62:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings. How may I help you?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=62 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:62:Greeting2"
msgid "Greetings. How may I help you?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=63 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:63:Greeting1"
msgid "Who are you? Clearly you are not of this realm. And how have you survived? I am amazed you have not been destroyed by the madness that has taken over my fellow earth dwellers!"
msgstr "누구요? 분명 이 세계의 존재는 아니군. 그런데 어떻게 살아남았소? 내 동료 대지 주민들을 사로잡은 광기에 파괴되지 않은 것이 놀랍소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=63 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:63:Greeting2"
msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr "다시 만나 반갑습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=64 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:64:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings. Though I have not yet succumbed to the madness, be aware! I feel its tug on my mind. I don't know how long I can hold out."
msgstr "안녕하시오. 아직 광기에 굴복하지는 않았지만 조심하시오! 광기가 내 정신을 잡아당기는 것이 느껴지오. 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을지 모르겠소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=64 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:64:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello again. You are still safe in my presence. The madness has not overtaken me."
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 아직은 제 곁에 있어도 안전합니다. 광기가 저를 덮치지 않았으니까요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=65 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:65:Greeting1"
msgid "The madness pulls at me, but still I maintain my sanity. If you have business with me, speak quickly. Even now I feel a compulsion to attack you!"
msgstr "광기가 나를 끌어당기지만 아직은 이성을 유지하고 있소. 용건이 있다면 빨리 말하시오. 지금도 그대들을 공격하라는 충동이 느껴지오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=65 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:65:Greeting2"
msgid "I am still in my own mind, but for how long I don't know. What do you want?"
msgstr "아직은 제정신이지만, 얼마나 더 버틸지는 모르겠소. 무슨 용건이오?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=66 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:66:Greeting1"
msgid "Fear not, plane-travelers. For reasons I do not understand, the madness that affects my brethren does not affect me. How can I help you?"
msgstr "두려워하지 마시오, 차원 여행자들이여. 이유는 모르겠지만 내 동족에게 영향을 주는 광기가 나에게는 통하지 않소. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=66 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:66:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=67 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:67:Greeting1"
msgid "Madness reigns these watery realms, but it does not rule me. Somehow I am not affected. How can I help you?"
msgstr "광기가 이 물의 영역을 지배하지만, 나까지 지배하지는 못하오. 어째서인지 나는 영향을 받지 않소. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=67 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:67:Greeting2"
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=68 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:68:Greeting1"
msgid "T-the madness p-pulls at my very soul. Each day is a st-struggle to maintain sanity. I w-will h-help you while I c-can, but be prepared to fl-flee!"
msgstr "과-광기가 내 영혼을 끌-끌어당기오. 매일 이성을 지키기 위한 싸-싸움이오. 할 수 있는 동안은 도-도와드리겠지만, 도-도망칠 준비는 해 두시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=68 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:68:Greeting2"
msgid "I s-still maintain my-myself. W-what is it y-you want?"
msgstr "아-아직은 제-제정신을 유-유지하고 있소. 무-무엇을 원하는 거요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=69 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:69:Greeting1"
msgid "Welcome to my sanctuary. I have proofed this chamber against the maddening magic which affects my fellow citizens. You are safe as long as you stay here. How may I help you?"
msgstr "내 성소에 온 것을 환영하오. 이 방은 다른 주민들에게 영향을 주는 광기의 마법을 막도록 방비했소. 이곳에 머무는 동안은 안전하오. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=69 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:69:Greeting2"
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=6 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:6:Greeting1"
msgid "Aren't you with the Merchant Caravan from Alvar?\nI need your help!"
msgstr "알바르에서 온 상단과 함께 온 분 아닙니까?\n도와주십시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=6 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:6:Greeting2"
msgid "The mountain of fire will surely destroy us!"
msgstr "불의 산이 분명 우리를 파멸시킬 거요!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=70 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:70:Greeting1"
msgid "I don't know what has befallen us, but it is awful! All my friends and family are affected by violent madness. Somehow I am not affected. But how can I help you?"
msgstr "우리에게 무슨 일이 생긴 건지는 모르지만 끔찍하오! 내 친구와 가족 모두가 폭력적인 광기에 사로잡혔소. 어째서인지 나만은 영향을 받지 않았소. 그런데 내가 무엇을 도와드릴 수 있겠소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=70 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:70:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=71 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:71:Greeting1"
msgid "So, I understand you're out for adventure. I'd be glad to join you!"
msgstr "모험을 찾아다닌다고 들었소. 기꺼이 함께하겠소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=71 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:71:Greeting2"
msgid "Welcome back! Have you decided to take me with you in your travels?"
msgstr "다시 오신 것을 환영합니다! 여행에 저를 데려가기로 결정하셨습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=72 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:72:Greeting1"
msgid "It is so boring around here! I mean, why did I spend all that time training if I'm not going to use my skills? Say, perhaps you could take me with you. Clearly you're headed someplace exciting!"
msgstr "이곳은 너무 지루해! 능력을 쓰지도 않을 거라면 왜 그토록 오래 훈련했겠어? 이봐, 나를 데려가는 건 어때? 당신들은 분명 흥미진진한 곳으로 가는 것 같으니까!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=72 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:72:Greeting2"
msgid "So, have you come back to take me on your adventure?"
msgstr "그럼, 모험에 저를 데려가려고 돌아오신 겁니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=73 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:73:Greeting1"
msgid "I know the elder Dragons would never approve, but I don't care! I want adventure, and you're the best chance I'll see. Can I go with you?"
msgstr "장로 드래곤들이 절대 허락하지 않으리라는 건 알지만 상관없소! 나는 모험을 원하고, 당신들이야말로 내가 모험을 떠날 최고의 기회요. 함께 가도 되겠소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=73 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:73:Greeting2"
msgid "So, can I come with you now? Can I?"
msgstr "그럼 이제 저도 함께 가도 됩니까? 정말요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=74 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:74:Greeting1"
msgid "Would you believe the Necromancers' Guild cast me out? I, Karanya Memoria? Fah! They were just jealous of my great potential. Not that this has stopped me from seeking dark knowledge--I do so now by my own path.Say, perhaps we could join forces!"
msgstr "강령술사 길드가 나, 카라냐 메모리아를 내쫓았다는 게 믿어지시오? 흥! 그들은 내 위대한 잠재력을 질투했을 뿐이오. 그렇다고 어둠의 지식을 추구하는 일을 멈춘 것은 아니오. 이제는 나만의 길로 탐구하고 있소.이봐, 우리 힘을 합치는 건 어떻소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=74 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:74:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=75 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:75:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings, travelers! Ah, how I envy your lives of adventure. You know, I too know the call of the open road. I myself once sought new experiences--strange lands, strange people, and whatnot. Sadly, those days are over for me."
msgstr "안녕하시오, 여행자들이여! 아, 모험으로 가득한 삶이 참 부럽군. 나도 한때는 열린 길의 부름을 따랐소. 새로운 경험과 낯선 땅, 낯선 사람 같은 것을 찾아다녔지. 안타깝게도 그런 시절은 이제 끝났소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=75 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:75:Greeting2"
msgid "Good to see you again!"
msgstr "다시 만나 반갑습니다!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=76 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:76:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings, and well met! I am Jasp Thelbourne--an Elf of daring deeds. This is no idle boast. You may have heard of the Idol of Seven Skunks? It was I who recovered it from the Temple of Eep for the Alvarian Merchant Guild."
msgstr "안녕하시오, 반갑소! 나는 대담한 위업을 이룬 엘프 재스프 셀본이오. 허풍이 아니오. 일곱 스컹크의 우상에 대해 들어 보았소? 알바르 상인 길드를 위해 윕의 신전에서 그것을 되찾은 사람이 바로 나요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=76 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:76:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello, again. How can Jasp Thelbourne, renowned adventurer do for you?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 명망 높은 모험가 재스프 셀본이 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=77 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:77:Greeting1"
msgid "I grow weary of the endless demands placed on my by my so-called \"master,\" the accursed Thant. He would have me stay here in Shadowspire as a guard. A \"guard,\" feh! I am meant for greater things. An adventure like yours is what I seek. Will you have me in your fellowship?"
msgstr "소위 '주인'이라는 저주받을 탄트가 끝없이 명령하는 데 지쳤소. 그는 나를 섀도스파이어에 남겨 경비를 서게 하려 하지. '경비'라니, 흥! 나는 더 위대한 일을 위해 태어났소. 당신들 같은 모험을 찾고 있소. 나를 동료로 받아 주겠소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=77 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:77:Greeting2"
msgid "Well, I'm still here, but I make preparations to leave as soon as an opportunity presents itself. Have you reconsidered? Will you take me now?"
msgstr "음, 아직 여기 있긴 하지만 기회가 생기는 즉시 떠날 준비를 하고 있소. 다시 생각해 보셨습니까? 이제 나를 데려가시겠소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=78 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:78:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings. I am Nathaniel Roberts. Without false modesty, I can say I am a mighty master of dark magic. It is your good fortune I have grown bored of Shadowspire and seek a company of adventurers such as yourselves to ally myself with. If you are agreeable, I will allow you to accompany me."
msgstr "안녕하시오. 나는 너새니얼 로버츠요. 거짓 겸손 없이 말하자면, 나는 강력한 어둠 마법의 대가요. 내가 섀도스파이어에 싫증을 느껴 당신들 같은 모험가 무리와 손잡으려 한다는 건 그대들에게 행운이지. 동의한다면 내가 그대들과 동행해 주겠소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=78 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:78:Greeting2"
msgid "So, you have reconsidered my offer. Will you now agree to become my followers?"
msgstr "내 제안을 다시 생각해 보았군. 이제 우리 추종자가 되겠는가?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=79 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:79:Greeting1"
msgid "So, a party of \"adventurers\"…hmmm. I suppose most dragons would just attack them outright, but then again I, Flamdring, have never been \"most dragons,\" no. Join them? Yes, perhaps I will. Perhaps I will."
msgstr "그래, '모험가' 무리라…흐음. 대부분의 드래곤이라면 당장 공격했겠지만, 나 플램드링은 결코 '대부분의 드래곤'이 아니었지. 합류한다고? 그래, 어쩌면 그러는 것도 좋겠군. 그래, 그렇게 하지."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=79 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:79:Greeting2"
msgid "Ah the adventurers return. Again the question arises: To join them or no? Yes, perhaps so…"
msgstr "아, 모험가들이 돌아왔군. 다시 그 질문이 떠오르는군. 함께할 것인가, 말 것인가? 그래, 어쩌면…"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=7 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:7:Greeting1"
msgid "It's the end of the world!\nThe Mountain of Fire will consume us all!"
msgstr "세상이 끝장날 거야!\n불의 산이 우리 모두를 집어삼킬 거라고!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=7 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:7:Greeting2"
msgid "It's the end of the world!\nThe Mountain of Fire will consume us all!"
msgstr "세상이 끝장날 거야!\n불의 산이 우리 모두를 집어삼킬 거라고!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=80 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:80:Greeting1"
msgid "How are you? I am Hevatia Deverbero, a member in full standing of the Necromancers' Guild."
msgstr "어떻게 지내시오? 나는 강령술사 길드의 정회원 헤바티아 데베르베로요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=80 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:80:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=81 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:81:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings, and may the Light shine on you. What can a humble priest of the Sun do for you today?"
msgstr "안녕하시오. 빛이 그대들을 비추기를. 태양을 섬기는 보잘것없는 사제가 오늘 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=81 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:81:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello again. May the Light shine on you."
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 빛이 당신을 비추기를."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=82 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:82:Greeting1"
msgid "Yes? Well, don't stand there tongue tied! I'm a busy man!"
msgstr "네? 거기서 말문이 막힌 채 서 있지 마시오! 나는 바쁜 사람이오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=82 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:82:Greeting2"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=83 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:83:Greeting1"
msgid "Hello, and good hunting to you. I am Sethrc Thistlebone, a warrior of this village, such as it is."
msgstr "안녕하시오. 사냥에 행운이 있기를. 나는 보잘것없는 이 마을의 전사 세스릭 시슬본이오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=83 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:83:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello, and good hunting!"
msgstr "안녕하시오, 사냥에 행운이 있기를!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=84 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:84:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings. Welcome to my home. I am Rionel, axe warrior of Balthazar Lair."
msgstr "안녕하시오. 내 집에 온 것을 환영하오. 나는 발타자르 소굴의 도끼 전사 리오넬이오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=84 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:84:Greeting2"
msgid "Welcome to my home."
msgstr "내 집에 온 것을 환영하오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=85 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:85:Greeting1"
msgid "Greeting! I am Adric Stellare, a former lieutenant of the Alvar Guard. I grew tired of the regimented lifestyle. Now I seek adventure."
msgstr "안녕하시오! 나는 알바르 경비대의 전직 부관 애드릭 스텔라레요. 규율에 얽매인 생활에 지쳤소. 이제 모험을 찾고 있소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=85 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:85:Greeting2"
msgid "Greetings!"
msgstr "안녕하시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=86 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:86:Greeting1"
msgid "I am Infaustus, elder vampire and adventurer. I will talk with you if you are brief. I am busy making preparations to leave. I go to seek my fortune across the lands of Jadame."
msgstr "나는 장로 뱀파이어이자 모험가인 인파우스투스요. 짧게 말한다면 대화해 주겠소. 떠날 준비로 바쁘오. 제이덤 전역을 돌아다니며 부와 명예를 찾을 생각이오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=86 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:86:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=87 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:87:Greeting1"
msgid "Very impressive performance. Reaching me was not easy. Perhaps you are the adventurers I seek. You see, I wish to explore the world, and these days, even a Dragon would be smart not to travel alone."
msgstr "아주 인상적인 솜씨였소. 내게 도달하는 것은 쉽지 않았을 텐데. 어쩌면 그대들이 내가 찾던 모험가들일지도 모르겠군. 나는 세상을 탐험하고 싶소. 요즘 같은 때에는 드래곤이라도 혼자 여행하지 않는 편이 현명하니까."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=87 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:87:Greeting2"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=88 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:88:Greeting1"
msgid "Hail, adventurers! I am Tempus, hunt leader and a knight of some renown in my native Erathia. What can I do for you?"
msgstr "모험가들이여, 반갑소! 나는 사냥대장이자 고향 에라시아에서 제법 이름난 기사 템푸스요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=88 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:88:Greeting2"
msgid "Hail!"
msgstr "만세!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=89 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:89:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings! I am the mighty Thorne Understone. I know we have not met before--I never forget a face--but perhaps you recognize my name from ballads. You know, several have been written about me."
msgstr "안녕하시오! 나는 위대한 손 언더스톤이오. 전에 만난 적은 없소. 나는 얼굴을 절대 잊지 않으니까. 하지만 노래를 통해 내 이름은 들어 봤을지도 모르겠군. 나에 관한 노래가 여러 곡 쓰였거든."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=89 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:89:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello again. What can the mighty Thorne do for you? Maybe I could sign my name on your shield as a keepsake. A lot of my fans seem to like that sort of thing."
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 강대한 손이 무엇을 해드릴까요? 기념으로 방패에 내 서명이라도 해드릴까요? 내 팬들은 그런 걸 꽤 좋아하는 모양이더군요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=8 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:8:Greeting1"
msgid "What are you doing here? Get my letter to Fellmoon!"
msgstr "여기서 뭐 하는 거요? 내 편지를 펠문에게 전하시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=8 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:8:Greeting2"
msgid "What are you doing here? Get my letter to Fellmoon!"
msgstr "여기서 뭐 하는 거요? 내 편지를 펠문에게 전하시오!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=90 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:90:Greeting1"
msgid "Hail! I am Ulbrecht, a hero of the Vori campaigns. Be welcome in my home."
msgstr "만세! 나는 보리 원정의 영웅 울브레히트요. 내 집에 온 것을 환영하오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=90 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:90:Greeting2"
msgid "It is good to see you again."
msgstr "다시 만나니 반갑군요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=91 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:91:Greeting1"
msgid "I wake after a sleep of thirty-four years, and already I have company! I see you have traveled far. Perhaps you can tell me what has transpired while I slumbered."
msgstr "서른네 해 동안 잠들었다 깨어났는데 벌써 손님이 왔군! 먼 길을 여행한 것 같소. 내가 잠든 동안 무슨 일이 있었는지 말해 줄 수 있겠소?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=91 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:91:Greeting2"
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "안녕하시오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=92 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:92:Greeting1"
msgid "I am Duroth the Eternal. By besting the guards you have earned the right of speaking to me. What do you want?"
msgstr "나는 영원한 듀로스다. 경비병들을 꺾었으니 나와 이야기할 권리를 얻었다. 무엇을 원하는가?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=92 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:92:Greeting2"
msgid "What brings you again to Duroth the Eternal?"
msgstr "영원한 듀로스를 또 찾아온 이유가 무엇이오?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=93 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:93:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings! I am Weldrick Falconeye, Dragon training specialist. What can I do for you today?"
msgstr "안녕하시오! 나는 드래곤 훈련 전문가 웰드릭 팰컨아이요. 오늘은 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=93 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:93:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello again…need any Dragons trained?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요…훈련시킬 드래곤이라도 있습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=94 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:94:Greeting1"
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "안녕하시오."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=94 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:94:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=95 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:95:Greeting1"
msgid "Sethrik Fist at your service. Fine coffins made to order."
msgstr "세스릭 피스트가 모시겠소. 주문 제작하는 최고급 관이 있소."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=95 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:95:Greeting2"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=96 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:96:Greeting1"
msgid "The call of madness it burns…burns! My mind…ahrgg! Wait! A moment of clarity…quickly! State your business! I can hold out for but a moment."
msgstr "광기의 부름이 타오른다…타올라! 내 정신이…아아악! 잠깐! 정신이 맑아졌다…어서! 용건을 말해라! 잠시밖에 버틸 수 없다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=96 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:96:Greeting2"
msgid "What…is…it…you…w-want?"
msgstr "무…무엇을…워…원하나?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=97 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:97:Greeting1"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "모험가여, 반갑소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=97 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:97:Greeting2"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "모험가여, 반갑소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=98 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:98:Greeting1"
msgid "Ahoy, matey!"
msgstr "어이, 선원!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=98 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:98:Greeting2"
msgid "Ahoy, matey!"
msgstr "어이, 선원!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=99 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:99:Greeting1"
msgid "What do you want? My research requires great concentration--a concentration you are breaking with you're intrusion!"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오? 내 연구에는 엄청난 집중력이 필요하오. 그런데 당신이 침입해서 그 집중을 깨뜨리고 있소!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=99 field=Greeting2 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:99:Greeting2"
msgid "You again? What is it?"
msgstr "또 당신이오? 무슨 일이오?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=9 field=Greeting1 status=translated
msgctxt "engine:npc_greet.txt:9:Greeting1"
msgid "Welcome aboard!\nMay you have smooth, swift seas!"
msgstr "승선을 환영합니다!\n바다가 잔잔하고 항해가 순조롭기를!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_greet.txt record=9 field=Greeting2 status=translated
