#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=111 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:111:Description"
msgid "Lifedrain allows the vampire to damage his or her target and simultaneously heal based on the damage done in the Lifedrain.  This ability does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 points of damage per skill."
msgstr "라이프드레인은 뱀파이어가 대상을 공격하여 피해를 입히고, 그 피해량만큼 자신의 생명력을 회복하는 기술입니다. 피해량은 3 + 기술 포인트당 1-3입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=111 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:111:Expert"
msgid "Faster recovery rate"
msgstr "회복 속도 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=111 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:111:GrandMaster"
msgid "Damage 7 points plus 1-7 per point of skill"
msgstr "피해량 7 + 기술 포인트당 1-7"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=111 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:111:Master"
msgid "Damage 5 points plus 1-5 per point of skill"
msgstr "피해량 5 + 기술 포인트당 1-5"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=111 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:111:Normal"
msgid "Vampire heals 1/3 the damage done by Lifedrain"
msgstr "뱀파이어가 라이프드레인으로 입힌 피해의 1/3만큼 회복"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=111 field=ShortName status=translated
