#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=122 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:122:Description"
msgid "This ability allows the Dragon to strike fear in its opponents' thoughts. If the target doesn't resist the effects, it will flee in panic for the duration of the effect."
msgstr "이 능력은 드래곤이 적의 정신에 공포를 심어줍니다. 대상이 효과에 저항하지 못하면 지속 시간 동안 공포에 질려 도망칩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=122 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:122:Expert"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes plus 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 5분 + 기술 점수당 1분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=122 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:122:GrandMaster"
msgid "Affects all creatures within view"
msgstr "시야 내의 모든 생명체에게 영향"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=122 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:122:Master"
msgid "Affects target and all creatures within immediate vicinity"
msgstr "대상 및 주변의 모든 생명체에게 영향"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=122 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:122:Normal"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 3분 + 기술 포인트당 1분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=122 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:122:ShortName"
msgid "Fear"
msgstr "공포"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=123 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:123:Description"
msgid "This ability is an upgraded version of the normal Dragon breath weapon attack.  It acts much like a fireball, striking its target and exploding out to hit everything near it, except the explosion does much more damage than most fireballs."
msgstr "이 능력은 일반적인 용의 숨결 공격의 강화 버전입니다. 화염구와 비슷하게 작동하여 대상을 타격하고 폭발하여 근처의 모든 것을 공격하지만, 폭발 피해량은 대부분의 화염구보다 훨씬 강력합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=123 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:123:Expert"
msgid "Damage 10 points plus 1-10 points per point of skill"
msgstr "피해량 10 + 기술 점수당 1-10"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=123 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:123:GrandMaster"
msgid "Damage 12 points plus 1-12 points per point of skill"
msgstr "피해량 12 + 기술 점수당 1-12"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=123 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:123:Master"
msgid "Damage 11 points plus 1-11 points per point of skill"
msgstr "피해량 11 + 기술 점수당 1-11"

