msgid "Flame Blast"
msgstr "화염 폭발"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=124 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:124:Description"
msgid "Allows the Dragon to carry the party in flight.  This ability is expensive and only works outdoors, but it is very useful.  Flight will drain one spell point every five minutes it is in use (i.e. when you aren't touching the ground)."
msgstr "드래곤이 파티를 태우고 비행할 수 있게 합니다. 이 능력은 비용이 많이 들고 야외에서만 작동하지만 매우 유용합니다. 비행 중에는 5분마다 주문 포인트가 1씩 소모됩니다(즉, 지면에 닿아 있지 않을 때)."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=124 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:124:Expert"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=124 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:124:GrandMaster"
msgid "No spell point drain"
msgstr "주문 포인트 소모 없음"

