#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=14 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:14:Description"
msgid "Increases all your characters� resistance to air damage by an amount equal to your skill in Air. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "모든 캐릭터의 공기 피해 저항을 공기 마법 기술 점수만큼 증가시킵니다. 보호 효과는 기술 점수당 1시간 동안 지속됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=14 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:14:Expert"
msgid "2 points resistance per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 저항 2 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=14 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:14:GrandMaster"
