#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=47 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:47:Description"
msgid "Fate can be used on a character to increase his chance to hit, or on a monster to decrease its chance.  The chance is modified by 20 + 1 per point of skill in Spirit Magic, and lasts until the target attacks, or 5 minutes go by."
msgstr "운명은 캐릭터에게 사용하면 명중률을 높이고, 몬스터에게 사용하면 명중률을 낮춥니다. 수정치는 20 + 정신 마법 기술 포인트당 1이며, 대상이 공격하거나 5분이 지날 때까지 지속됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=47 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:47:Expert"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "보너스 또는 페널티 20 + 기술 포인트당 2"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=47 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:47:GrandMaster"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 6 per point of skill"
msgstr "보너스 또는 페널티 20 + 기술 포인트당 6"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=47 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:47:Master"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 +4 per point of skill"
msgstr "보너스 또는 페널티 20 + 기술 포인트당 4"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=47 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:47:Normal"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "보너스 또는 페널티 20 + 기술 포인트당 1"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=47 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:47:ShortName"
msgid "Fate"
msgstr "운명"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=48 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:48:Description"
msgid "Forces all visible undead monsters to flee until the duration of Turn Undead runs out.  This spell lasts for 3 minutes plus one minute per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "시야 내의 모든 언데드 몬스터가 언데드 퇴치 주문의 지속 시간 동안 도망치게 합니다. 이 주문은 3분 + 정신 마법 기술 포인트당 1분 동안 지속됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=48 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:48:Expert"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 3분 + 기술 포인트당 3분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=48 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:48:GrandMaster"
msgid "Faster recovery"
msgstr "회복 속도 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=48 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:48:Master"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 5 per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 3분 + 기술 포인트당 5분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=48 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:48:Normal"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 3분 + 기술 포인트당 1분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=48 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:48:ShortName"
msgid "Turn Undead"
msgstr "언데드 퇴치"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=49 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:49:Description"
msgid "Removes the cursed condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the �point of no return� is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr "제시간에 시전하면 캐릭터의 저주 상태를 제거합니다. 정신 마법의 기술과 숙련도가 높을수록 '돌이킬 수 없는 지점'에 도달하기 전까지 더 오랫동안 저주 상태를 유지할 수 있습니다. 그 이후에는 신성한 개입을 제외하면 사원을 방문하는 것만이 유일한 해결책입니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=49 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:49:Expert"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 1시간 미만으로 저주받은 경우 효과 적용"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=49 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:49:GrandMaster"
msgid "No time limit"
msgstr "시간 제한 없음"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=49 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:49:Master"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 1일 미만으로 저주받은 경우 효과 적용"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=49 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:49:Normal"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=49 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:49:ShortName"
msgid "Rmv. Curse"
msgstr "저주 해제"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=4 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:4:Description"
msgid "Causes a weapon that has no special abilities to burn with a magical fire, giving the weapon the \"of Fire\" ability.  This spell lasts for one hour per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr "특수 능력이 없는 무기를 마법의 불꽃으로 감싸 \"화염의\" 능력을 부여합니다. 이 주문은 화염 마법 스킬 포인트당 1시간 동안 지속됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=4 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:4:Expert"
msgid "Grants \"of Flame\""
msgstr "불꽃의 부여"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=4 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:4:GrandMaster"
msgid "Grants \"of Infernos\" permanently"
msgstr "지옥불의 영구 부여"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=4 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:4:Master"
msgid "Grants \"of Infernos\""
msgstr "지옥불의 부여"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=4 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:4:Normal"
msgid "Grants \"of Fire\""
msgstr "화염의 부여"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=4 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:4:ShortName"
msgid "Fire Aura"
msgstr "화염 오라"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=50 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:50:Description"
msgid "Preservation more tightly binds the soul to the body. This will delay death due to massive hit point loss, but will not stop a character from going unconscious. If a preserved character's hit points are too low when the spell wears off, he or she will die."
msgstr "영혼을 육체에 더 강하게 결속시킵니다. 막대한 생명력 피해로 인한 죽음을 지연시키지만, 캐릭터가 의식을 잃는 것을 막지는 못합니다. 주문 효과가 끝날 때 생명 보존 상태인 캐릭터의 생명력이 너무 낮으면 캐릭터는 사망합니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=50 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:50:Expert"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 5 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 1시간 + 기술 포인트당 5분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=50 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:50:GrandMaster"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 15 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 1시간 + 기술 포인트당 15분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=50 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:50:Master"
msgid "Works on entire party"
msgstr "파티 전체에 적용"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=50 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:50:Normal"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=50 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:50:ShortName"
msgid "Preservation"
msgstr "생명 보존"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=51 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:51:Description"
msgid "Heroism increases the damage a character does on a successful attack by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Spirit Magic. This spell affects the entire party at once."
msgstr "영웅심은 캐릭터의 공격 성공 시 피해량을 5 + 정신 마법 기술 포인트당 1점만큼 증가시킵니다. 이 주문은 파티 전체에 적용됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=51 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:51:Expert"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 5 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 1시간 + 기술 포인트당 5분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=51 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:51:GrandMaster"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 1시간 + 기술 포인트당 1시간"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=51 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:51:Master"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 15 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "지속 시간 1시간 + 기술 포인트당 15분"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=51 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:51:Normal"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=51 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:51:ShortName"
msgid "Heroism"
msgstr "영웅심"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=52 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:52:Description"
msgid "This spell weakens the link between a target's body and soul, causing 10 + 2-8 points of damage per point of skill in Spirit Magic to all monsters near the caster."
msgstr "이 주문은 대상의 육체와 영혼 사이의 연결을 약화시켜, 시전자 주변의 모든 몬스터에게 10 + 정신 마법 기술 포인트당 2-8의 피해를 입힙니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=52 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:52:Expert"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=52 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:52:GrandMaster"
msgid "Faster recovery rate"
msgstr "더 빠른 회복 속도"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=52 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:52:Master"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate"
msgstr "보통 회복 속도"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=52 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:52:Normal"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=52 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:52:ShortName"
msgid "Spirit Lash"
msgstr "영혼 채찍"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=53 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:53:Description"
msgid "Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer a character can have been dead before the �point of no return� is reached.  After that, the only way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr "제시간에 이 주문을 시전하면 죽은 캐릭터를 소생시킵니다. 정신 마법의 기술과 등급이 높을수록 '돌이킬 수 없는 지점'에 도달하기 전까지 캐릭터가 죽어 있을 수 있는 시간이 길어집니다. 그 이후에는 신성한 개입을 제외하면 사원을 방문하는 것만이 캐릭터를 소생시킬 수 있는 유일한 방법입니다. 이 주문을 시전하면 캐릭터는 허약 상태가 됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=53 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:53:Expert"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=53 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:53:GrandMaster"
msgid "No time limit"
msgstr "시간 제한 없음"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=53 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:53:Master"
msgid "Works if dead less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 1일 미만으로 사망한 경우 작동"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=53 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:53:Normal"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=53 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:53:ShortName"
msgid "Raise Dead"
msgstr "소생"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=54 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:54:Description"
msgid "Shared Life combines the life force of your characters and redistributes it amongst them as evenly as possible.  All current hit points are totaled and 3 extra points per point of skill in Spirit Magic is added to this total. Then the points are distributed back to the characters, with no individual character being allowed to have more points than his maximum total hit points."
msgstr "생명 공유는 캐릭터들의 생명력을 합쳐 가능한 한 균등하게 재분배합니다. 현재 모든 생명력을 합산하고 정신 마법 기술 포인트당 3점을 추가합니다. 그 후 합산된 생명력을 캐릭터들에게 다시 분배하며, 어떤 캐릭터도 최대 생명력을 초과하여 가질 수 없습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=54 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:54:Expert"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=54 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:54:GrandMaster"
msgid "Adds 4 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 4의 생명력을 합계에 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=54 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:54:Master"
msgid "Adds 3 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 3의 생명력을 합계에 추가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=54 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:54:Normal"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=54 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:54:ShortName"
msgid "Shared Life"
msgstr "생명 공유"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=55 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:55:Description"
msgid "Resurrects a character whose body has been destroyed.  Recovery rate is very slow, but will be faster for characters with a higher skill in Spirit Magic.  The resurrected character will be in a weak condition after this spell is cast."
msgstr "파괴된 육체를 가진 캐릭터를 부활시킵니다. 회복 속도는 매우 느리지만, 정신 마법 기술이 높을수록 빨라집니다. 부활한 캐릭터는 주문 시전 후 허약 상태가 됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=55 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:55:Expert"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=55 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:55:GrandMaster"
msgid "This spell is as good as it will ever get!"
msgstr "이 주문은 이미 최고의 성능을 발휘하고 있습니다!"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=55 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:55:Master"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=55 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:55:Normal"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=55 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:55:ShortName"
msgid "Resurrection"
msgstr "부활"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=56 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:56:Description"
msgid "Caster reads the target's mind, finding out exactly how much gold and what items the target has."
msgstr "대상의 마음을 읽어 소지한 금화의 정확한 액수와 아이템을 알아냅니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=56 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:56:Expert"
msgid "Faster recovery rate"
msgstr "회복 속도 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=56 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:56:GrandMaster"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate"
msgstr "회복 속도 매우 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=56 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:56:Master"
msgid "Faster recovery rate"
msgstr "회복 속도 증가"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=56 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:56:Normal"
msgid "Slow recovery rate"
msgstr "느린 회복 속도"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=56 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:56:ShortName"
msgid "Telepathy"
msgstr "텔레파시"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=57 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:57:Description"
msgid "Removes the afraid condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the spell no longer is effective.  After that, the condition may only be removed by resting or at a temple."
msgstr "적절한 시기에 시전하면 캐릭터의 공포 상태를 제거합니다. 정신 마법 기술과 숙련도가 높을수록 공포 상태가 지속된 시간이 길어도 효과가 유지됩니다. 그 시간이 지나면 휴식을 취하거나 사원에서만 상태를 제거할 수 있습니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=57 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:57:Expert"
msgid "Works if afraid less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 1시간 미만의 공포 상태에 효과적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=57 field=GrandMaster status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:57:GrandMaster"
msgid "Works no matter how much time has passed"
msgstr "시간 경과와 관계없이 항상 효과적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=57 field=Master status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:57:Master"
msgid "Works if afraid less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 1일 미만의 공포 상태에 효과적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=57 field=Normal status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:57:Normal"
msgid "Works if afraid less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 3분 미만의 공포 상태에 효과적"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=57 field=ShortName status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:57:ShortName"
msgid "Remove Fear"
msgstr "공포 해제"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=58 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:58:Description"
msgid "Increases all your characters� resistance to Mind Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Mind Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "모든 캐릭터의 정신 마법 피해 저항을 정신 마법 기술 수치만큼 증가시킵니다. 보호 효과는 기술 포인트당 1시간 동안 지속됩니다."

