#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=89 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:89:Description"
msgid "Reanimate allows you to raise a lifeless creature from the dead (sort of).  The zombie will fight against monsters hostile to the caster until it is killed (again) or until the party leaves the map.  The zombie will have 10 hit points per point of skill in dark magic, up to its normal maximum. This spell cannot be cast on party members."
msgstr "시체 소생은 죽은 생명체를 (어느 정도) 다시 일으켜 세웁니다. 좀비는 파괴되거나 파티가 맵을 떠날 때까지 시전자를 적대하는 몬스터와 싸웁니다. 좀비는 어둠 마법 기술 포인트당 10의 생명력을 가지며, 최대 생명력까지 회복됩니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt record=89 field=Expert status=translated
msgctxt "engine:spells.txt:89:Expert"
