msgid "Placeholder Text"
msgstr "자리표시자 텍스트"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt record=4 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:trans.txt:4:Description"
msgid "You find a passage leading downwards. Do you enter?"
msgstr "아래로 이어지는 통로를 발견했습니다. 들어가시겠습니까?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt record=508 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:trans.txt:508:Description"
msgid "The back door to the mysterious abandoned temple built by the race which lived on Dagger Wound before the Lizardmen--it should be safe now, right?"
msgstr "리자드맨 이전에 대거 운드에 살았던 종족이 세운 수수께끼의 버려진 신전 후문입니다. 이제는 안전하겠지요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt record=50 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:trans.txt:50:Description"
msgid "Placeholder Text"
msgstr "자리표시자 텍스트"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt record=5 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:trans.txt:5:Description"
msgid "The volcano has apparently pulled this ancient building from the bottom of the sea. Who were it's mysterious builders?"
msgstr "화산이 바닷속에 가라앉아 있던 이 고대 건물을 끌어올린 듯합니다. 이 수수께끼의 건축물을 세운 자들은 누구였을까요?"

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt record=671 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:trans.txt:671:Description"
msgid "Placeholder Text"
msgstr "자리표시자 텍스트"

