#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt record=8 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:trans.txt:8:Description"
msgid "A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  The dead bodies near his home might have been adventurers seeking the dragon's treasure."
msgstr "이 동굴에는 분명 거대한 드래곤이 살고 있습니다. 둥지 근처의 시체들은 드래곤의 보물을 노리던 모험가들이었을지도 모릅니다."

#. assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt record=9 field=Description status=translated
msgctxt "engine:trans.txt:9:Description"
msgid "The enormous size and lavish decoration of Lord Markham's Manor provide a striking contrast to the humble peasant homes and huts nearby."
msgstr "마크햄 경의 저택은 엄청난 규모와 호화로운 장식으로, 주변의 소박한 농가와 오두막과 뚜렷한 대비를 이룹니다."

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D02.str record=5 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D02.str:5"
msgid "You've Rescued a child!  How patriarchal of you"
msgstr "아이를 구출했습니다! 참으로 가부장적이군요."

