#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=11 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:11"
msgid "Ca-Click!"
msgstr "철컥!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=12 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:12"
msgid "Snick!"
msgstr "찰칵!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=18 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:18"
msgid "\"You cannot see me, hear me or touch me.  I lie behind the stars and alter what is real, I am what you really fear, Close your eyes and come I near. What am I?\""
msgstr "나를 볼 수도, 들을 수도, 만질 수도 없다. 나는 별들 뒤에 숨어 현실을 뒤바꾸며, 네가 진정 두려워하는 것이다. 눈을 감으면 내가 다가온다. 나는 무엇인가?"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=21 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:21"
msgid "Answer?  "
msgstr "정답은?"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=22 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:22"
msgid "Incorrect"
msgstr "틀렸습니다."

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=23 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:23"
msgid "\"I go through an apple, or point out your way, I fit in a bow, then a target, to stay. What am I?\""
msgstr "나는 사과를 꿰뚫고, 길을 가리키기도 한다. 활에 걸렸다가 과녁에 박힌다. 나는 무엇인가?"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=26 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:26"
msgid "\"What consumes rocks, levels mountains, destroys wood, pushes the clouds across the sky, and can make a young one old?\""
msgstr "바위를 삼키고 산을 깎으며 나무를 썩게 하고 구름을 하늘로 밀어 보내며 젊은이를 늙게 하는 것은 무엇인가?"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=28 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:28"
msgid "\"Alive without breath, as cold as death, never thirsty ever drinking, all in mail never clinking, ever travelling, never walking, mouth ever moving, never talking.  What am I? \""
msgstr "숨 없이 살아 있고 죽음처럼 차갑다. 목마르지 않으나 늘 마시며, 비늘 갑옷을 입었으나 소리 나지 않는다. 늘 움직이지만 걷지 않고, 입을 움직이지만 말하지 않는다. 나는 무엇인가?"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6D08.STR record=31 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6D08.STR:31"
msgid "Magical Wall"
msgstr "마법의 벽"

