#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6T7.STR record=6 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:6T7.STR:6"
msgid "\"Expert Perception is the key and the doors of Baa will let you be.                                                                                                                                                                                                                  The Spiral then each head, talk to Baa or you'll be dead.\""
msgstr "전문가 수준의 지각력이 열쇠이며, 그러면 바의 문이 너를 받아들이리라. 나선을 따른 뒤 각 머리에게 말하라. 그렇지 않으면 죽으리라."

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/6T7.STR record=7 field=Text status=translated
