#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/CD1.STR record=10 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:CD1.STR:10"
msgid "\"Etched into the tree a message reads:                                                                                                                                                                                                                              The second is next to the third, oh so pretty like a bird!\""
msgstr "나무에 글이 새겨져 있습니다. 둘째는 셋째의 옆자리, 새처럼 아름답구나!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/CD1.STR record=11 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:CD1.STR:11"
msgid "\"Etched into the tree a message reads:                                                                                                                                                                                                                              The third is the first of twenty six, A through Z you'll have to mix!\""
msgstr "나무에 글이 새겨져 있습니다. 셋째는 스물여섯 중 첫 번째. A부터 Z까지 잘 섞어 보아라!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/CD1.STR record=12 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:CD1.STR:12"
msgid "\"Etched into the tree a message reads:                                                                                                                                                                                                                              The fifth is twice the second, five letters in all I reckon!\""
msgstr "나무에 글이 새겨져 있습니다. 다섯째는 둘째의 두 배. 모두 다섯 글자일 것이다!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/CD1.STR record=13 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:CD1.STR:13"
msgid "\"Etched into the tree a message reads:                                                                                                                                                                                                                              The forth is eight from the end, Archibald really is your friend!\""
msgstr "나무에 글이 새겨져 있습니다. 넷째는 끝에서 여덟 번째. 아치볼드는 정말 네 친구다!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/CD1.STR record=14 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:CD1.STR:14"
msgid "What's the password?"
msgstr "암호는 무엇입니까?"

