msgstr "틀렸습니다!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/CD1.STR record=18 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:CD1.STR:18"
msgid "Ok!"
msgstr "좋아!"

#. assets_dev/worlds/mm6/_legacy/events/CD1.STR record=19 field=Text status=translated
msgctxt "world:mm6:CD1.STR:19"
msgid "\"Who told you!  Alright, you may pass!\""
msgstr "누가 알려 준 거지! 좋아, 지나가도 된다!"

